<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Siyara Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukor Leka Kušir Hóbor</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lukor leka kušir hóbor</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Foriso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Ãrar bout kiye ãrar butoror goṭona okkol zin zin ãrar maze goiṭṭe hinore leka šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Foila loti hitara zara nizor suke deikke edde bala hóbor tobolig goijje hitara ãrar hãse zendilla zanaiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Hendilla ãi o šuruttu loti hár goṭonare bala gori zasai basai gori bade, o adoijja Teofilos, ãi tũwar hãse he goṭonagunore kulasa bafe leka bala mone gorilam. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Zene ze kissu šikka tũi faiyo, hin soiyi oi ne naki no zani faro.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahya zormo oibar agam hóbor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Ehudiyar badša Herudor ṭaimot, heṛe Abiyas dolor ekzon imam aššil, zar nam Zakariya. Hitar bou o Harun guštir maya fuwa. Hibar nam aššil Elizabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Hitara dunizon Allar šaikkat forhesgar aššil. Mabudor har hokum edde niyom mozin hitara niduši bafe solito. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Hitarattu hono fuwain no aššil, kiyollahoile Elizabet aššilde bázá. Ar hitarar umor o beši oil.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ek din Zakariyaye hibar dolor fala mozin Allar sarme imamoti ham goijjil. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Toi imamoti hamor niyom mozin dusora imam okkole loṭari maijje, henot Zakariyar nam uiṭṭe edde hibattu Mabudor pak zagat goli duf zala foijje. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Duf zalaibar ṭaimot mainše battu tai munazat goijje.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>En šomot dufgar ḍen ḍakottu Mabudor ek firistaye Zakariyare deha diye. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Toi Zakariyaye he firistare deki hibar mon hoisali oi uiṭṭe edde beša beši ḍoraiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Kintu firistaye Zakariyare hodde: "No ḍorais Zakariya, tor duwa kobul gora oiye. Tor bou Elizabete tolla ek futore biyaibo, ar tui hitar nam rakibi Yahya. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Hite tolla ek kuši edde ullaš oibo, ar hite zormo owa loi boute kuši oibo, <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>kiyollahoile hite Malikor nozorot mohan oibo, edde šoraf otóba hono ḍoilla mod no fibo; ar enki hite mar feṛottu loti he Pak Ruhuye furaiya oibo. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Hite Israilor beša beši manuš okkolore hitarar Allah Malikor hãse firai anibo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Eliyas nobir ḍoil hanggam edde šokti loi, hite Malikor age aibo, bab okkolor mon fuwaindor uzu firaibolla, edde naforman mainšor monor báfore bodoli, Allar formandar mainšor monor báfor ḍoilla goribolla, zene Malikolla ek dol manušore furafuri bafe tiyar gori fare."<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakariyaye firistare hodde, "Iyan ãi kene ekin goijjum? Kyollahoile ãi to bura, edde ãr bouwe fuwa biyaibar boyoš o farai giyegoi."<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Firistaye hitare hodde, "Ãi Zibrail ze Allar sarme tiyai taki. Tor loi hota hoibolla edde ei kušir hóbor dibolla ãre defeṛa oiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Ar sa, ehon loti in okkol ze din goṭibo, he din foijjonto tui buk oi takibi edde hota hoi no faribi, kiyollahoile tui ãr hota biššaš no goros. Kintu ãi ze hota hoiyi hin šomoi mozin furon oibo."<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Ar eṛe bare manuš okkole Zakariyalla entezar gori taikke. Dórmogóror pak zagar butore hibaye deri gorer deki hitara tajjuf oi bafa šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Bade Zakariya zehon niyoli aišše, hibaye hitara loi mati no fare. Hitara buijjede dórmogóror pak zagar butore hameka hibaye hono deha faiye, kiyollahoile hibaye hitarar loi šude išara bišara gorat roiye edde buk oi roiye.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Tarfore Zakariyar fala zehon šeš oiye, hite hitar górot firi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Hotodin bade Zakariyar bou Elizabet hamil oiye edde fãs maš foijjonto hiba mainšor arguwal oi roiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Elizabete hodde, "Iyan Mabudor ham. Mainšor sarme ãttu šorom no lagefan Allaye ehon ãr mikka suk tuli saiye."<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosi zormo oibar agam hóbor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Bade Elizabet so maišša hamil oiyede šomot, Allaye Zibrail firistare Galil elehar Nasarat farar ek kumarir hãse defeṛaiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Hibare loi badša Daudor bongšor Yusuf name ekzon loi hibar biyar hotabattara ṭik oil. He kumarir nam Moriyam. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Firistaye hibar munttu zaiyore hodde, "Tor šanti ok! Tui ḍõr rahamot faiyos! Mabud tor fũwati ase."<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Ei hota funi Moriyamor mon beši hoisalit fori gilgoi, ar mone mone bafa šuru goijje ei solamor mani ki hoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Kintu firistaye hibare hodde, "No ḍorais Moriyam; kiyollahoile tui Allattu rahamot faiyos. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Ar fun! Tui hamil oibi edde tottu ek futore biyaibi, ar hibar nam rakibi Isa. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Hiba mohan oibo, hibare šorbo šoktiwalar fut ḍaka oibo. Allah Mabude hibar baf Daudor šingašon hibare dibo. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Yakubor bongšor uwore hibaye abadul abad razagiri goribo, ar hibar razagiri hono din šeš no oibo."<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Moriyame firistare hodde, "En ken gori oi faribo? Ãi aizo kumari?"<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Firistaye zuwabe hibare dedde, "Pak Ruh tor uwore aibo, edde šorbo šoktiwalar šokti tor uwore saiya oibo. Hetolla ze paki zon zormo oibo hibare Allar Fut ḍaka oibo. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ar sa, tor egena Elizabet, hibattu o ei bura boyošot ek fut feṛot oiye. Hiba zare bázá hoito, hibattu iyan so mašor san. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Kiyollahoile Allattu ošombob kissu nai."<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Moriyame hodde, "So, ãi Mabudor bandi, tũwar hota mozin ãr uwore har kissu ok." Tarfore he firista Moriyamor henttu giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elizabetor górot Moriyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Hotodin bade Moriyame toratori gori Ehudiya elehar ek fahari farat giye, <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>zeṛe Zakariya take. Hiba heṛe Zakariyar górot góille edde Elizabet loi mulot oiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabete zehon Moriyamor abaz fuinne hetunot hibar feṛor fuwaye fal mari uiṭṭe. Ar Elizabet he Pak Ruhuye furon oiye edde <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>zure ḍak mari hodde: "Har nari okkolor butore tore rahamot, ar rahamot ze fuwa tor gorbot ase. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Iyan ki bafe oi fare, ãr Malikor mattu ãr hãse aiya foijje? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Ãi zẽtte tor abaz funilam hẽtte ãr gorbot ãr fuwaye kušiye fal mari uiṭṭe. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ar rahamot tore, tui biššaš goijjos, ar hetolla tor babute Mabude zen hoiye, hen furon oibo!"<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Moriyamor šukurana gozol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Hetunot Moriyame hodde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">"Ãr forane Malikor šanor tarif gorer!<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ar ãr ruh ãr basailoya Allare loi kušiye ullaš,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>kiyollahoile hibaye ei nihait gorib bandir uwore nozor diye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Ar so, ehonottu loti hár mainše ãre mubarak hoibo.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>kiyollahoile hiba, he Šoktiwalaye ãlla beši ḍõr ham okkol goijje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">paki oilde hibar nam.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>hibar doya bongšor bade bongšolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">zara Hibare ḍorar.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Allaye nizor ḍũwa loi ḍõr šoktir ham goijje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">Zarar nizor dilot ohonkare bora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">hitarare Allaye šiṛa šitta gori felaiye.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Allaye šingašonottu raza okkolore lamai diye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">kintu nisorgunore usolot goijje.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Zetarattu obaf ase, hitarare bala bala hána fani diye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">kintu tuwangor okkolore hali hate bidai goijje.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Allaye ãrar fordada okkolor hãse ze wada dil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">he mozin hibaye hibar gulam Israilore ufohar goijje.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Ibrahim edde hibar bongšor manuš okkolor uwore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">abadul abad adorhatir goribar hota Allaye monot raikke."<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Ar Moriyam maš tin maš Elizabetor górot taki bade nizor górot uwafes firi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Torikotor gusol doya Yahyar zormo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Bade zehon Elizabete fuwa biyaibar din furon oiye, hibaye ek futore biyaiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>ar hibar ḍen gór bam gójja edde egena okkole fuinne ze, Mabude hibare hoto ḍõr ador dehaiye, edde hitara hibar fũwati kuši goijje.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ašṭo dinor din hitara fuware azomi goraito aišše, edde hibar bafor nam mozin hitara fuwar nam Zakariya rakito saiye, <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>kintu fuwar maye zuwabe hodde: "No, hitar nam Yahya raka oibo."<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Hitara hibare hodde, "Tũwar egena okkolor butore hono kiyor nam to Yahya nai."<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Bade hitara fuwar bafore išara gori hibattu zainto saiye fuwar nam ki rakito so hoi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakariyaye ekkan lekibar silet maigge edde heṛe leikke: "Itar nam Yahya." Henot beggune ammuwak oiye. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Ar hehon Zakariyar muk kuligiyegoi edde zil eridiya oi giyegoi, toi hibaye Allare tarif gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Hen deki atehasor manuš okkol beggune beši ammuwak oiye. Henot ze hanḍo okkol goiṭṭe hinor babute Ehudiyar har fahari elehar manuš okkole howa hoi gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Mabudor hat ei fuwar uwore aššil buli zedune ei hota okkol fuinne hitara hin dilot raikke edde fusar goijje: "Ḍõr oile ei fuwa ki oibo?"<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariyar šukurana gozol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Hibar baf Zakariyaye he Pak Ruhuye furaiya oi nobi hisabe hota hoiye, hodde:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>"Israilor Allah Mabudor tarif ok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">kiyollahoile hibaye nizor mainšor uzu suk diye edde deha šunar bar loiye.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Allaye ãralla hibar gulam Daudor bongšottu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ekzon šoktiwala basailoiya tuille.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>(Ei wadare Allaye bout age hibar pak nobi okkolor muke howaiye.)<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Dušmon okkolor edde zara ãrare hingša gore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">hitarar hatottu basaibo.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Allaye ãrar bafdadare doya dehaiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">edde hibar paki wadare monot raikke,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>he wadare hibaye ãrar baf, Ibrahimor hãse dil:<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>Hetolla ãra dušmon okkolor hatottu ḍor sara uddar oiyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">toi zene ãra zetodin basi, Allar sukor sarme<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>pak saf edde soiyi bafe Allar šeba gori fari.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Ar oh ãr fuwa, tore šorbo šoktiwalar nobi hoi ḍaka oibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">kiyollahoile tũi Malikor age age zaibi edde Malikor fõt ṭik goribi.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Edde Malikor manuš okkolore uddar sinaibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">hẽtte hitarar guna maf gora oibo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>kiyollahoile ãrar Allar doyaye boraiya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Uworwalar fohor beil uṛefan oibo ãrar uwore,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>zara andarot edde morar sabat boi roiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">edde ãrare šantir fõtot solai fare."<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Ar fuwawa bari uiṭṭe edde ruhuye mojbut oiye; Israili okkolor munttu aibar age foijjonto Yahya bošoti sara elehat maze zibon haṛaiye.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosir zormo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Moti 1:18–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Hẽttiyaror din okkolot Rom dešor badša Agustusor hokum zari oiye, ze šara raijjor hár manuš okkolottu nam leka diya foribo. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Siriyar šašon goroya Kuronir ṭaimot ei foila bar manuš gona oiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Har mainše nam leka dibolla nizor nizor farat za šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Ar Yusuf aššilde badša Daudor bongšor manuš. Badša Daudor zormostan aššilde Ehudiya elehar Betlehem šohorot. Hetolla Yusuf o nam leka dibolla Galil elehar Nasarat farattu uwore Daudor šohor Betlehemot gil. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Moriyam, zar loi Yusufor biyar hotabattara ṭik oil, ar he šomot hiba hamil aššil, hibaye o Yusufor fũwati nam leka dibolla heṛe giye. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Hitara heṛe giyede šomot hibar fuwa halasi oibar ṭaim oiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Toi hibaye foila fuwa morod fuwa halasi goijje. Ar hibaye he fuware hoor berai di hanḍailot neṛai diye. Kiyollahoile hitaralla heṛe hiyan sara ar hono mikka takibar zaga no aššil.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Heṛe maṛot ḍakeduke hoekzon soolsoroya aššil, zara raitta soolor zãk fahara dil. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Ar Allar ek firista ai hitarar sarme hazir oiye. Toi Allar nuror tozolli sairo mikka oiye, henot soolsoroya okkole beši ḍoraiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Firistaye hitarare hodde, "No ḍoraiyo, kiyollahoile so, ãi tũwarare beši ḍõr kušir hóbor zanaito aišši; ei kuši hár manušolla oibo. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Kiyollahoile aziya Daudor šohorot tũwaralla ek basailoya zormo oiye; hiba oilde Mosi, Malik. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ei hota soyide hiyanor sinno oilde, tũwara ek gura fuware hanḍailot hoor beraiya neṛaiya dekiba."<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Bade atikka he firistar fũwati ek ḍõr firistar dol behostottu ai zug diye edde hitara beggune Allare ganor šure tarif gora šuru goijje:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>"Uwore behostot Allar tarif ok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">edde duniyait hibar manuš okkolor maze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">zitarare loi Allah kuši hitarar uwore šanti ai ok!"<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Firista okkol zehon hitarar henttu behostot giyegoi, soolsoroya okkole ekzone ekzonore hodde: "Aiyo, ãra Betlehem foijjonto zai, ze hota Allaye ãrare firistar duwara zanaiye hin saigoi."<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Toi hitara toratori he zagat fõiššegoi, heṛe Moriyam edde Yusuf, hanḍailot neṛaiya he gura fuwar deha faiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Hitara he fuware deki bade he fuwar babute zin zin firistaye soolsoroya okkolore hoil hin hitara itarare zanai diye. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Ar zedun mainše soolsoroya okkolor hota fuinne, hitara beggune tajjuf oiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Kintu Moriyame he šob hota mone mone bafa šuru goijje edde hin nizor dilot gãti raikke. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Ar soolsoroya okkolore zendilla howa oil, hitara hendilla hár kissu deki funi Allare tarif edde šukuriya zaniye. Toi bade hitara henttu uwafes firi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Ašṭo din bade fuware azomi goraibar ṭaim oiye, ar hẽtte nam raka oiye Isa. Mar feṛot aibar age firistaye ei namman dil.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuwa Isare dórmogórot loigiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Bade zehon Musar šoriyotot mozin pak saf oibar ṭaim oiye. Toi Yusuf edde Moriyame gura fuwa Isare Mabudor sarme tiya goraibolla Zeruzalemot loigiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Zendilla Mabudor ainot leka ase, "Foila zormor har morodore Mabudor dora oibo." <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Hin bade o hitara kurbani goitto giye, zendilla ainot kurbani dibar hota leka ase: "Ek zura faikor so otóba duwa hoitoror basa."<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Hẽtte Zeruzalemot Simeon name ekzon dórmiyo edde allawala manuš aššil. Allaye hõtte Israil zatir dukkore dur goribo he ṭaimolla hibaye sai aššil. Pak Ruh hibar uwore aššil, <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>ar Pak Ruhur duwara hibare batelai diya oi ze, Malik Messiyare no dekite hibar mout no oibo. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Toi hiba Pak Ruhor išara faiyore dórmogórot aišše. Ar zehon ma bafe fuwa Isare ainor rosom mozin furon goribolla dórmogóror butore ainne.<verse eid="LUK 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simeonor Šukurana Gozol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Hetunot Simeone hibare fatarikula gori loiye edde Allar tarif gori hodde:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>"Mabud, tũi tũwar kalam mozin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">tũwar gulamore ehon šanti gori bidai goijjo,<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>kiyolla buli hoile ãr dui suke tũwar uddarore dekilam,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>ziyan tũi har zatilla bebosta goijjo.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Oihudi okkolor hãse forhaš oibar nur,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ar tũwar zati Israilolla ijjot."<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Hibar babute hoiyede hin okkolot fuwar baf edde ma tajjuf oiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Ar Simeone hitarare duwa goijje edde Isar mare hodde: "Sa, ei fuwaye Israilor butore boutore tole felaibo edde uwore tulibo, ar iba en ek sinno oibolla aišše zar bifokke boute matibo. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Henot hitarar monor sinta forhaš oi zaiboi. Hin bade o, Moriyam tor dilot surir agator ḍoilla duk oibo."<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Ar heṛe Hanna name ekzon maya fuwa nobi aššil, hiba aššilde Ašar bongšor Panuwelor zi, hibar umor beši oil. Hiba zuwan hale hãt bosor zamair gór gori bade, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>aši sair bosor umor o foijjonto rari boni takkil. Ar hiba dórmogórot ruza edde munazat loi dine raite Allar ebadotot fori takito. Hibaye dórmogór sari hono mikka no zaitogoi.<verse eid="LUK 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>He šomot Hannaye o heṛe aiyore šukuriya adai gora šuru goijje edde zedun manuš Zeruzalem azadir entezarot aiššil, hitarare hibaye Isar babute hoiye.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Toi hitara Mabudor ain mozin hár kissu fura gori bade Galil elehat, hitarar nizor fara Nasaratot firi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Ar fuwawa bari uiṭṭe edde mojbut oiye, giyane furaiya oiye, edde Allar rahamot hibar uwore aššil.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa baro bosojja taite dórmogórot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Uddar idor šomot Isar ma bafe fotti bosor Zeruzalem zaito. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Toi hiba zẽtte baro bosor oiye, hẽtte hitara hitarar idor niyom mozin uwore Zeruzalem giye; <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Toi idor din okkol šeš oi bade, hitara firi zargoide šomot, fuwa Isa fissa Zeruzalem tai giyegoi, ar hibar baf maye hiyan no zanito. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Isa mainšor fũwati maze ase mone gori ek dinor fõtor baisa foijjonto hitara ai giyegoi. Bade hitara hitarar egena edde sina funa manuš okkolottu Isar talaš gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Hitara zehon Isare tuwai no fa, hitara Isare tuwaibolla uwafes firi Zeruzalem giye. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Šeše, tin din bade hitara Isare dórmogórot tuwai faiye. Isaye heṛe alem okkolor maze boi hitarar hota funat aššil edde hitarare suwal fusar goijjil. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Zara Isar hota fuinne hitara Isar ahol deki edde zuwab funi beggune tajjuf oiye. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Isar baf maye Isare deki ammuwak oiye. Maye Isare hodde: "Oh fut, tũi ãrar loi en kiyolla goijjo? Tũwar baf edde ãi hoto suhara oi tũware tuwa šuru goijjilam."<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Kintu Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara kiyolla ãre talaš goijjila? Tũwara no zano ze ãttu ãr bafor górot taka foribo?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Kintu Isaye hitarare ki hoiye hin hitara buzi no fare.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Tarfore Isa hitarar fũwati Nasarat uwafes firi giyegoi, edde baf mar hota mani soille. Isar maye in beggunore dilot gãti raikke. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Isa giyane edde boyoše bari uiṭṭe, Allah edde manušor adore.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Torikotor gusol doya Yahyar tobolig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Badša Ṭaiberiyar razagiri fundoro bosor soledde šommot, Ehudiya elehar govarnar aššilde Pontus Filat. Hẽtte Herud Galil elehar, ar hitar bái Filip, Ituriya edde Trakonitisor šašon goroya aššil. Ar Lusaniyas aššilde Abileniya elehar šašon goroya. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Annas edde Kaifas aššilde Ihudi okkolor ḍõr imam. Ṭik he šomot Allar kalam bošoti sara elehat maze Zakariyar fut Yahyar hãse aišše. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Ar hibaye Zordan giriyore asede hár zaga okkolot giye edde mon firaibar ek torikotor gusol tobolig goijje, ziyane guna okkolore maf diye, <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Zendilla Esaiyah nobir kitabot iyan leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">"Bošoti sara elehat ek abaze guzori zanaider,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">'Tũwara Mabudor fõt ṭik goro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">hibar rasta uzu goro.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Har ḍeil okkol bora oibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mura fahar fuwan gora oibo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Behã sura fõt fuwan gora oibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">bešoman rasta šoman gora oibo.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Ar hár mainše Allar uddar dekibo.'"<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Beši manuš okkole Yahyattu torikotor gusol loibolla niyoli giye edde hibaye hitarare hodde: "Hafor dol okkol! Tũwarare Allar gozob lami aiyerde henttu dai zaibolla hũšiyar gori hone dilo? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Toile gunattu mon firaiyode hiyanor laikka gula dorai tũwarar zibonot deho. Mone mone howa šuru no goijjo ze, 'Ãrattu baf Ibrahim ase.' Kiyollahoile ãi tũwarare hoir, Allaye ei fattor okkolottu Ibrahimolla fuwain fodai gori fare. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ar gasor gurat kuroil ehon loti lagaiya ase. Ze hono gas zibat bala gula no doribo, hiba haṛi oinot felai diya oibo."<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Toi mainšor dol okkole Yahyare fusar goredde, "Toile ãrattu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yahyaye hitarare hodde: "Zattu duwa kuruta ase, hite zattu nai hitare uggwa dok. Ar zar hãse haiddo ase, hite o hen gorok."<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Ar heṛe hazna adaigoroya o torikotor gusol loibolla aišše. Hitara Yahyare hodde, "Ustad, ãrattu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Hibaye zuwab diye, "Ainot zen ase henor beši adai no goijjo."<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Šoinno okkol hoekzone o fusar goijje, "Ãrattu ki gora foribo?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Hibaye hitarare hodde, "Hono kiyottu zurgori otóba oinnai bafe kissu adai no goijjo. Tũwara tũwarar beton loi razi tako."<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Ar manuš okkole Mosilla entezar gori taikkede hisabe beggune mone mone bafa šuru goijjede,Yahya i Mosi oit fare. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Hetunot Yahyaye hitara beggunore hodde, "Ãi tũwarare fani loi torikotor gusol dir ṭik, kintu en ekzon aiyer, ze ãttuwaro šoktiwala. Ãi hibar zutar fita kuli dibar laikka o no. Hibaye tũwarare Pak Ruh edde oin loi torikotor gusol dibo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Kula hibar hatot ase, hõlat gĩyur dana zari foriškar goribolla. Gĩyur dana hinore hibar nizor gudamot rakibo, kintu tušore hono din no nifede hendilla oin loi furaidi felaibo." <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yahyaye aro bout hota hoi manuš okkolore Allar diya kalam tobolig goijje.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Kintu Yahyaye badša Herudore jejeṛaiye, kiyollahoile hite hitar bái bou Herudiyare loi taikke edde aro bout kuham okkol goijje, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>hitar oinno kuham okkolor fũwati aro ekkan noya kuham zug diye, hiyan oilde Yahyare ziyolot diye.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye torikotor gusol loiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ar zẽtte hár manuš okkole Yahyar hãse zaiyore torikotor gusol lor, Isaye o torikotor gusol loiye. Ar hibaye munazat goredde šomot asman kuligiyegoi, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>edde he Pak Ruh ek hoitoror sonna loi Isar uwore lami aišše, ar behostottu ei abaz aišše: "Tui ãr he adoijja Fut, tor uwore ãi kub kuši."<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar bongšor nam okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Onumanik tiriš bosor oiyede šomot Isaye ham šuru goijje. Mainše mone goittode mozin Isa Yusufor fut, Yusuf Elir fut.<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eli Mattátor fut, Mattát Levir fut, Levi Melkir fut, Melki Zannaiyor fut, Zannaiyor fut Yusuf, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yusuf Mottitiyar fut, Mottitiya Amošor fut, Amoš Nahumor fut, Nahum Ešalir fut, Ešali Nogir fut. <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nogi Mator fut, Mat Mottitiyar fut, Mottitiya Šimiyor fut, Šimiyo Yusekor fut, Yusek Zodar fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Zoda Yohananor fut, Yohanan Resar fut, Resa Serubabelor fut, Serubabel Salṭiyolor fut, Salṭiyol Nerir fut. <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri Melkir fut, Melki Addir fut, Addi Kušomor fut, Kušom Elimadamor fut, Elimadam Eror fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Er Yosuvar fut, Yosuva Eliyesoror fut, Eliyesor Zorimor fut, Zorim Mattátor fut, Mottot Levir fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Levi Simeonor fut, Simeon Ehudar fut, Ehudah Yusufor fut, Yusuf Yonamor fut, Yonam Eliyakimor fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyakim Meleyar fut, Meleya Minnar fut, Minna Mottotiyar fut, Mottotiya Natanor fut, Natan Daudor fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Daud Yasiror fut, Yasir Obedor fut, Obed Buazor fut, Buaz Salmonor fut, Salmon Nahušonor fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nahušon Omminadabor fut, Omminadab Adomanor fut, Adoman Ornir fut, Orni Hešronor fut, Hešron Ferošor fut, Feroš Ehudar fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Ehudah Yakubor fut, Yakub Isakor fut, Isak Ibrahimor fut, Ibrahim Ṭerar fut, Tera Nahuror fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahur Šorugor fut, Serug Reuor fut, Reu Felegor fut, Feleg Eberor fut, Eber Šelar fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Šela Kenanor fut, Kenan Arpákšador fut, Arpákšad Šemor fut, Šem Nuhor fut, Nuh Lemekor fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lemek Metúšalar fut, Metúšalah Honnukor fut, Honnuk Yaredor fut, Yared Mahalalelor fut, Mahalalel Kenanor fut, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenan Enošor fut, Enoš Šetor fut, Šet Adamor fut, adom Allar Fut.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Isare dúha diya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Isa, Pak Ruhor šoktiye furaiya oiyore Zordanottu firi aišše edde he Pak Ruhor išaraye bošoti sara elehat sairi goijje, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>zeṛe hibare sališ din foijjonto šoitane dúha diye, ar he din okkolot maze Isaye hána hono kissu no há, he din okkol šeš oi bade hibattu buk laigge.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Toi Šoitane Isare hodde, "Tui zodi Allar Fut oi, toile ei fattorguware ho ruṭi oizagoi."<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Isaye hitare zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Iyan endilla leka ase: 'Manuš šude ruṭi loi no base.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Tarfore Šoitane Isare ek usol faharor uwore loigiye edde ek sator butore duniyair hár raijjore dehaiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Toi Šoitane Isare hodde, "Ãi tore ei hár odihar edde zak zomok diyum; kiyollahoile in ãre diya oiye, ar ãttu zare issa lage ãi hitare di. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Hetolla tui zodi ãre sojida goros, toile in beggun tor oibo."<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Isaye zuwabe hitare diye: <char style="wj">"Leka ase: 'Tũi tũwar Mabud Allare sojida goro, edde lehar hibare šeba goro.'" </char><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Tarfore Šoitane Isare Zeruzalemor uwore loigiye edde dórmogóror tulir uwore tiya goraiyore hodde: "Tui zodi Allar Fut, toile enttu nise zaf mar. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Kiyollahoile kitabot leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">"'Hibaye hibar firista okkolore tor babute hokum dibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">tore uddar goribolla.<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Hitara tore hatot gori tuli loibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">zene tor ṭengot fattoror ujaṭ no lage.'"<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Kintu Isaye hitare zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Iyan endilla howa oiye: 'Tũi tũwar Allah Mabudore forikka no goijjo.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Šoitane hibare hár ḍoilla gori dúha diya šeš oi bade, toi hite olfo ṭaimolla hibar hãsottu dur oigiyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Nasarator sinagogot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Ruhor šoktit Isa Galilot firigiye edde elehar hár zagat hibar hóbor sorai giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Isaye hitarar bout sinagog okkolot šikka diye edde beggune Isare tarif goijje.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Isa Nasarat fara aišše, zeṛe hiba zuwan oil. Dórmor din Isaye nizor rosom mozin sinagogot giye. Heṛe hibaye pak kalam foribolla uṛi tiyaiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Tarfore hibar hatot nobi Esaiyar leka kitabwa diya oiye. He rol beraiya kitabwa kuli hibaye he zagagan faiye zeṛe leka ase:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <char style="wj">"Allah Mabudor Ruh ãr uwore ase,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">kiyollahoile Allaye ãre ṭik goijje </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">zene ãi gorib okkolor hãse kušir hóbor tobolig gori.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Hibaye ãre bondi okkolor hãse azadir hota,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">anda okkolor hãse nozor danor hota gušona goribolla defeṛaiye.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Zene zara zulum far hitarare ãi rehai gori fari.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <char style="wj">edde Mabudor rahamotor bosor elan gori."</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Tarfore Isaye he rol beraiya kitabware berai hademor hatot diye edde boišše. Muzolišhanar fotti mainšor suk Isar uzu oiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Isaye hitarare en hoi šuru goijje, <char style="wj">"Pak kitabor ei kalam tũwara funone aziya hiyan furon oiye."</char><verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Henot beggune Isar babute goba diye edde Isar mukottu rahamoti hota funi hitara beggune tajjuf oiye. Hitara hodde, "Iba Yusufor fuwa no?"<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara ãre hameka en boson hoiba: 'Ḍakṭor, age nizore aramgor!' Aro hoiba 'Kofornahum šohorot zen zen gora oiye boli funni hendilla eṛe niz farat o hen gori deha.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Isaye aro hodde: <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, hono nobire nizor farar mainše no gose.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Ar ãi tũwarare hoir, soiyi oilde nobi Eliyasor ṭaimot zẽtte šaro tin bosor zór noddil edde har deš okkolot raṭ oil, hẽtte Israil dešot beša beši rari mayafuwain okkol aššil.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><char style="wj">Kintu Eliyasore hitara honokiyor hãse defeṛa no o, bolke Sidon elehar Šarifot farar ek rari mayafuwar hãse defeṛa oil.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Nobi Elišar ṭaimot Israil dešot bout kurus biyaraimma okkol aššil, kintu hitara honokiyore aram gora no o, bolke Siriya dešor Namanore aram gora oil."</char><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ei hota funi he muzolišhanar manuš beggun guššaye oin oiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Ar hitara uṛi Isare he farattu ṭeli niyolai loi za šuru goijje. Hitara ze faharot fara bainde hiyanor haindar uwore loigiye edde Isare nise feli dito saiye. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar mazottu ãṛi giyegoi, honokiye Isare sui no fare.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye bod ruhuye faiya manuš bala goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Isaye nise Galil elehar Kofornahum šohorot giye edde dórmor din manuš okkolore šikka diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Manuš okkole Isar šikkat tajjuf oiye, kiyollahoile hibar kalam kemotawola aššil.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Heṛe sinagogot napak butor ruhuye failde ekzon manuš aššil. <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>He manušwaye ḍak mari hodde: "Oh, Nasarator Isa, õne loi ãrar loi ki talukkat? Õne ki ãrare binaš goitto aiššo? Ãi zani õne honnuwa, õne Allar he Pak zon!"<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Kintu Isaye hibare dõk diyore hodde: <char style="wj">"Nizam o, ei manušwar butottu niyoli ai."</char> Toi he bod ruhuye manušware mainšor sarme meṛit asari felai raki hitar butottu niyoli giyegoi, manušwar hono hoti no o.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Manuš okkol beggune tajjuf oiyore hitara ekzonore ekzone hodde: "In ki hota! Odihar edde šokti loi napak but okkolore hokum de, ar hitara niyoli aiye!" <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Toi ei hóbor he elehar hár mikka sorai giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Bade Isa muzolišhanattu niyoli Simonor górot giye. Hẽtte Simonor hori zor biyaram loi beši hošto fat aššil. Hetolla hitara hibare aram goribolla Isar hãse foriyad goijje. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Toi Isaye Simonor horir ḍake tiyai zor biyaramore dõk diye. Ar hibattu zor sari giyegoi edde hibaye hehon uṛi hitaralla hána danar bebosta goijje.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Beil dufedde ṭaimot maze, manušzon okkole har biyaraimma zara ḍoilla boḍoilla biyaram loi hoštofar, hitarare Isar hãse ainne. Isaye hitara fottizonor uwore hat raikke, edde hitarare aram goijje. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ar beši mainšottu bod ruh niyoli giyegoi, bod ruh okkole guzori hodde, "Tũi Allar Fut!" Kintu Isaye hitarare dõk diye edde hoito no de, kiyollahoile hiba Moside hiyan hitara zainto.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Din zehon oiye Isaye he zagattu zaigoire ekkan nirzon zagat giye. Manuš okkole Isare tuwai tuwai hibar hãse giye. Hitara Isare berai dori taikke zene hiba hitarar hãsottu no zagoi. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Kintu Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Aro bout zagat zai ãttu Allar raijjor kušir hóbor tobolig goragoi foribo, kiyollahoile Allaye ãre in goribolla defeṛaiye."</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Tarfore Isaye Ehudiya elehar sinagog okkolot zai zai kušir hóbor tobolig gorat taikke.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Isar foila sahabi okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Ek šome Isa Gennesaret halor farot tiyaiye. Heṛe manuš okkole Isattu Allar kalam funibolla ṭelaṭeli goijje. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Isaye sadde halor hãsat duiyan no ase, kintu zailla okkole henttu lami zai zal duwer. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Henot oi duiyan nor butottu, Isaye Simonor not uiṭṭe. Ar hitare nogan kulottu ekkena dure loi zaibolla hoiye. Toi Isaye not boi manuš okkolore šikka diya šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Isaye hota howa šeš gori bade hibaye Simonore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tui tor noganore entu maze loi za, ar mas saibolla tor zal felagoi." </char><verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simone hodde, "Ustad, ãra šara rait mehennot gori kissu no fai, tarfore o õne zehon hor, ãi zal felaiyum."<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Hitara zal felaiye bade en masor ḍõr zãk dora foijje, zenneki hitarar zal udda siri zaitoi saiye. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Henot hitarar šiyardar okkol zara oinno not ase, hitarare o hate išara gori ḍaikke, zene hitara aiyore itarare modot gori fare. Hitara aiyore duiyan no en bafe mas loi botti goijje, zene no duniyan dufi zaibar alamot oiye.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Ei hanḍo deki Simon, zare Fitor hoi o ḍake, hite Isar sarme uite fori hodde, "Malik õne ãr hãsottu zogoi, ãi gunagar." <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Kiyollahoile zalot eto mas dora foijje, Simon edde hitar sãti okkol beggune tajjuf oiye, <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>ar hendilla ekkui bafe Simonor šiyardar, Sebudiyusor fuwain Yakub edde Yuhanna o tajjuf oiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Hetunot Isaye Simonore hodde, <char style="wj">"No ḍorais, ehon loti tui manuš doribi." </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Tarfore hitara hitarar nogunore kulor uwore tuli felaiyore, hár kissu felai raki Isar fisa loiye.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek kurus biyaraimma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Isaye ek bar ek šohorot giye. Heṛe ekzon kurus biyaraimma manuš aššil, zar hara ga gáye furaiya aššil. Isare deki he manušwaye meṛir uzu oi uite fori Isattu duwa sai hodde, "Malik, õne issa gorile ãre bala gori fariba."<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Isaye hat ṭani hitare suiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi sai, tũi foriškar o!" </char> Ar hehon hitar kurus biyaram bala oi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Isaye hitare endilla hokum diye, <char style="wj">"Ei hota honokiyore no hois, bolke zaiyore dórmiyo Alem okkolore dehagoi, toi bade saf oi faijjosde hiyanolla Musar ain mozin ekkan kurbani gorgoi. Henot mainšor hãse tui foriškar oiosde hiyanor forman oibo." </char><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Tarfore o Isar hóbor aro beši sorai giyegoi. Isar hota funibolla edde biyaraimma okkol aram oibolla bout manuš okkol Isar hãse aiya šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Kintu Isaye hamiša nirzon zagat zai duwa gorito.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek leng manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Ek din Isaye šikka der, hen šomot Foroši <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Foroši </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zara Ihudi dórmor šasiyot goroya</char></note>okkol edde dórmiyo alem okkol Isar hãse ai boiššegai. Hitara aššilde Galil edde Ehudiya elehar bout fara okkolor edde Zeruzalem šohoror manuš okkol. Biyaraimma aram goribolla Mabudor šokti Isattu aššil. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Hetunot hoekzon mainše ekzon leng biyaraimmare haiṭṭa loi bar gori ainne. Hitara hitare butore loi zaiyore Isar sarme rakito saiye. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Kintu zamila buli hitare butore loizaibar fõt no fa. Hetunot hitara góror salor uwore uiṭṭe edde salor sani hana gori bisana šo hitare manuš okkolor maze Isar sarme lamai diye.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Isaye hitarar biššaš dekiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Bondu, tor guna maf gora oiye!" </char><verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Henot dórmiyo alem edde Foroši okkole mone mone bafa šuru goijje, "Ite honnuwa, ze Allare ofoman gorer? Allah sara ar honokiye guna maf gori di no fare!"<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Hitara mone mone ki sinta goijje Isaye buzi fariyore hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara mone mone hendilla ka bafor? </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/><char style="wj">Tor guna maf gora oiye howa asan oibo ne naki tui uṛi ãṛi bera howa asan oibo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/><char style="wj">Kintu duniyait guna maf gori dibar kemota Adomor Futottu ase, hiyan zene tũwara zani faro." </char> Hen hoi Isaye he leng manušwar mikka firi hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tore hoir, uṭ, tor bisanagan tuli loi górot zagoi." </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Ar manušwa hehon beggunor sarme tiyaiye edde hite neṛi aššilde bisanagan tuli loiye, edde Allare šukuriya gori gori górot giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Henot beggune kub tajjuf oiye edde Allare šukuriya zanaiye. Ar hitarattu Allar ḍor góille edde hodde, "Aijja ãra ki tajjuiffa ham dekilam!"<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekzon Levire Isaye ḍaikke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Tarfore Isa henttu niyoli giyegoi edde dekedde Levi name ekzon hazna adaigoroya, hite hazna tulede zagat boi taikke. Isaye Levire hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãr fisa lo!" </char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Toi hite o uiṭṭe edde hitar hár kissu felai raki Isar fisa loiye.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Bade Levi manušwaye hitar górot Isalla ek ḍõr hána goijje. Heṛe aro bout hazna adaigoroya okkol edde aro bout manuš okkol šoho hitarar fũwati hána haito boišše. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Hetunot heṛe aššilde Foroši okkol edde hitarar dórmiyo alem okkole Isar sahabi okkolore nališ gori hodde, "Tũwara hazna adaigoroya edde gunagar okkol loi kiyolla há fiya goro?"<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Kintu zuwabe Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Araimma mainšottu ḍakṭoror dorhar nai, kintu biyaraimma mainšottu dorhar ase.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/><char style="wj">Ãi forhesgar okkolore no, kintu gunagar okkolore ḍakito aiššide, zene hitara gunattu mon fira." </char><verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruzar babute suwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Toi hitara hibare hodde, "Yahyar šagirit okkole hamiša ruza rake edde munazat gore, Foroši okkolor šagirit okkole o hen gore, kintu õnor sahabi okkole há fiya gorat take."<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Dula fũwati taite dular fũwajja okkolore ki tũwara ruza rakai fariba?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/><char style="wj">Kintu en šomoi aiyer, zẽtte hitarar hãsottu dulare loi za oibo, ar he din okkolot hitara ruza rakibo." </char><verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Hibaye hitarare ekkan mesal kahani o hoiye: <char style="wj">"Noya kurutattu ṭura siri honokiye furan kurutat tali no laga. Kiyollahoile, hen gorile to noya kurutawa siri fela o. Ar he noya taligan o furan kurutar fũwati no mana.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/><char style="wj">Otóba honokiye no ḍale tottoza šoraf furan samorar hoillat. Kiyollahoile ḍalile he tottoza šorafgune hoillagunore fuṛai felaibo, henot šorafgun o goli zaiboi edde hoillaguno o nošto oi zaiboi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/><char style="wj">No, tottoza šoraf noya samor hoillat raka foribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/><char style="wj">Furan šoraf hái bade honokiye tottoza šoraf haito no sa, kiyollahoile hite hoibo, 'Furangun bala beši.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Dórmor dinor babute suwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Hono ek dórmor din Isaye fõtot hono ek gĩyuketi bai gil. Isar sahabi okkole giyũrdanar sora siri hatot góši góši há šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Hetunot hozon forošiye hodde, "Ain mozin dórmor din zin gora mana hin kiyolla goror?"<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Daud edde hibar fũwajja okkolottu zehon buk laggil hẽtte ki goijje hin ki tũwara no foro?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><char style="wj">Hibaye to Allar górot goillil, edde sarme rakkilde ruṭi loi háil edde hibar fũwajja okkolore dil, zin šude imam okkole haibar ain ase."</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Bade Isaye he Foroši okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Adomor Fut oilde dórmor dinor malik."</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ar ek dórmor din Isaye sinagogot giye edde šikka diye. Heṛe en ekzon manuš aššil zar ḍen hat mozigiyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Dórmiyo alem okkol edde Foroši okkole, Isaye dórmor din he manušware aram gore ki no gore hiyan saibolla, hitara Isar uwore bala bafe nozor raikke. Toi zene hitara Isare hosuri dibar haron tuwai fa. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar monor sinta zainto. Hetolla he hat mozi giyegoide manušware Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Uṛi beggunor munttu ai tiya!"</char> Henot hite uṛi tiyaiye.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Isaye dórmiyo alem okkol edde Foroši okkolore hodde,<char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare ekkan hota fusar gori, dórmor din ki gora ezajot ase? Bala ham gora ne naki horaf ham gora? Foran basa ne naki foran dongšo gora?" </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Tarfore Isaye sairo ḍakor beggunor mikka sai manušware hodde: <char style="wj">"Tor hattan mum mikka ṭan."</char> Hite hen goijjebar hitar hattan ekkubare bala oi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Hetunot hitara guššaye heṛe uzora uzori oi giyegoi edde Isare ki gora zaibo he babute hitara hitara biyasana goijje.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye he barozonore asab oibolla ḍaikke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Moti 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mark 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>He din okkolot ekdin hiba munazat goribolla ek faharor uwore uiṭṭe, edde heṛe hibaye Allar hãse munazat gorat šara rait haṛai diye. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Bade binna zehon oiye, hibaye hibar šahabi okkolore ḍaikke edde hitarar butottu barozonore basi loiye, zarare asab hoi nam diye:<verse eid="LUK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simon, zare Isaye Fitor hoi nam diye edde hitar bái Andreas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yakub,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yuhanna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Filip,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Bartolomeus,<verse eid="LUK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Moti</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Ṭomas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Alfeusor fuwa Yakub,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Simon, zare bahadur Zelot hoito,<verse eid="LUK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yakubor fut Ehudah,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">edde Ehudah Iskariyot, ze Isare dušmon okkolor hatot dori diye.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye šikka diye edde biyaram bala goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Moti 4:23–25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-10">Mark 3:7–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Hibaye hitarare fũwati loi faharottu abar lami giye edde ekkan fuwainna zagat tiyaiye. Heṛe hibar ek ḍõr sahabi okkol edde Šara Ehudiyattu, Zeruzalem edde doriyar hãsar Sidon edde Tirosottu o aro bout beši manuš okkol, <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>zara heṛe hibar boyan funibolla edde biyaramottu aram oibolla heṛe aišše. Ar zara napak ruh loi duk fail, hitarare o hibaye bala goijje. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Edde hár mainše hibare suibolla kušiš goijje, kiyollahoile hibar butottu ek šokti niyoli gil edde harkiyore aram goijjil.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bala edde burar babute šikka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Isaye sahabi okkolor uzu suk tuli hodde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">"Allar rahamot tũwarar uwore zara gorib,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">Allar raijjo tũwarar.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Allar rahamot tũwarar uwore zara ehon waišša,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">tũwarar buk miṭa oibo.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Allar rahamot tũwarar uwore zara ehon handor,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">tũwara hašiba.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">Allar rahamot tũwarar uwore, zẽtte Adomor Futolla buli,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">mainše tũwarare hingša gore,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">tũwarare šomazottu niyolai de, ar ofoman gore,</char></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">edde tũwarar nam horaf hoi tũwarare batil gore.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>
    <char style="wj">"He dinot anondo goro edde kušiye fal maro, kiyollahoile, so, behostot tũwaralla enam beši ḍõr. Kiyollahoile hitarar bafdada okkole o nobi okkolor loi endilla bebohar okkol gorito.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu bifod tũwarare, zara tuwangor,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">tũwara tũwarar šantona faifelaiyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Bifod tũwarare zara ehon feṭ borai faror</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">tũwarattu buk lagibo.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Bifod tũwarare zara ehon hašor,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">tũwara bilak goriba edde handiba.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Bifod tũwarar, zẽtte hár mainše tũwarare šunam gore.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">Hitarar bafdada okkole o bonḍo nobi okkolore hendilla goitto.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dušmonore o muhabbot goro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu tũwara zara funor ãi hitarare hoir: Tũwarar dušmonore o muhabbot goro, zara tũwarare hingša gore hitarare balai goro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/><char style="wj">Zara tũwarare bodduwa de, hitarare duwa goro. Zara tũwarare ninda gore hitaralla munazat goro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/><char style="wj">Ze tũwar ek galot suwar mare, hitar mikka oinno galo lagai diyo, ar ze tũwar saddor kuli lor, hitare bazu kuli loite o mana no goijjo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/><char style="wj">Ar ze honokiye tũwattu kissu sa, hitare diyo, edde ze honokiye tũwarar hono kissu loi za, hin ar uwafes no saiyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Funo, mainše tũwarare zendilla gorok aša goro, tũwara o hitarar loi hendilla bebohar goro.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar zara tũwarare muhabbot gore, šudu hitarare muhabbot gorile tũwara ki gun faiba? Hendilla muhabbot to horaf mainše o gori take.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/><char style="wj">Ar zara tũwarar ufohar gore, šudu zodi hitarar ufohar goro, toile tũwara ki gun faiba? Hendilla to gunagar mainše o gore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/><char style="wj">Ar zarar hãsottu uwafes faibar aša take, hali zodi hitarare udar do, toile tũwara ki gun faiba? Horaf mainše o horaf manuš okkolore udar de, zene hedun firaifa. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwara nizor dušmonore o muhabbot goro edde hitarar balai goro. Uwafes faibar aša no raki udar do. Toile tũwarar enam ḍõr oibo edde tũwara šorbo šoktiwala Allar fuwain oiba. Haron Allah našukur edde horafore o doya gore. </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/><char style="wj">Tũwarar behostiyo Baf zendilla rahamoti, tũwara o hendilla rahamoti o.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duši no goijjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar tũwara bisar no goijjo, henot tũwarare o bisar gora no oibo. Duši no goijjo, henot tũwarare o duši gora no oibo. Tũwara sari do, henot tũwarare o sari diya oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/><char style="wj">Dan goro, henot tũwarare o diya oibo. Beši forimane sibi sibi, zankai zankai, zaf di forefan gori tũwarar kulot diya oibo, kiyollahoile tũwara ze bafe mafi do, he bafe tũwaralla o mafa oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Ar hibaye ekkan boson o hoiye: <char style="wj">"Ekzon andaye ki ar ekzon andare fõt dehai faribo? Dunizon gorot fori no zaiboi ne? </char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><char style="wj">Šagirit ustator uwore no, kintu ze furafuri šikka fa, hite hitar ustator ḍoilla o.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar tũwar báiyor sukot ze hal ase hiyan kiyolla dekor, kintu tũwar nizor sukot ze gasor ḍõr seli ase hiyan kiyolla bafi no sor?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/><char style="wj">Tũwar sukot ze gasor seli ase hiyan zehon no dekor, toile tũi ken gori ar ekzonore hoi faror, 'Bái aiyo, ãi tũwar sukottu hallan loifelai, 'Oh munafek! Age nizor sukor gasor ḍõr seli hiyan loifela, toi bade tor báiyor sukot ze hal ase hiyan loi felaibolla foriškar gori dekibi.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gas edde gula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bala gasot horaf gula dorede hendilla hono hota nai, ar hendilla horaf gasot o bala gula no dore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><char style="wj">Gula sai gas sinaza. Mainše keṛarzalittu ḍuirgula ba kẽṛagasottu ãngur no tule.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><char style="wj">Bala manuše hitar dil boraiya balattu bala hota bair gori ane, ar horaf mainše hitar dil furaiya horafottu horaf hota bair gori ane, kiyollahoile zar dil zine furaiya, hitar gale hin ho.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mojbut gór edde mojbut node gór</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwara ãre Malik, Malik hoi ka ḍako, ãi ziyan hoi hiyan zodi no goro?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/><char style="wj">Ze honokiye ãr hãse aiye, ãr hota fune edde he mozin gore, hite hár ḍoilla ãi tũwarare dehai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/><char style="wj">Hite en ekzon manušor ḍoilla, ze gór bandibolla murgori meṛi kuijje edde fattoror uwore faiya gãijje. Bade he góror uwore boinna aišše edde ḍollor fani aišše, to górganore lari no fare, kiyollahoile hiyan mujbut gori banda oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/><char style="wj">Ar ze ãr hota fune, kintu he mozin no gore, hite en ekzon manušor ḍoilla, ze faiya no gãri meṛir uwore gór bainde. Bade he górot ḍollor fani aišše, hetunot he górgan fori ekkubare dongšo oi giyegoi."</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ek šenafotir biššaš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Toi Isaye manuš okkolore šikka diya šeš gori bade hiba Kofornahum šohorot giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Heṛe ekzon Rom šenafotir gulamottu ošuk oi foran zar zar oiye. Ei gulamore he šenafotiye beši ador gorito. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Hite Isar hóbor funi hoekzon Ihudi murobbi mainšore Isar hãse aroz goribolla defeṛaiye zene Isaye zai hitar gulamore aram gori fare. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Hitara Isar hãse zai Isare beša beši aroz gori hodde, "Õne zalla ei ham goriba hite iyan faibar laikka, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>kiyolla buli hoile hite ãrar mainšore ador gore edde ãrare sinagog banai diye." <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Henot Isa hitarar fũwati giye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Isaye hitar góror hãsa hãsi aišše de hetunot, oi šenafotiye hitar hoekzon fũwajjare hoi defeṛaiyede: "Malik, nizore ar duk no diyo, kiyollahoile õne ãr góror salor tole aiyo, ãi he laikka no. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ar ãre ãi o õnor hãse aibar laikka mone no gori. Kintu õnor muke ho, henot ãr gulam bala oi zaiboi. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ãi iyan zani, kiyollahoile ãttu o oinno zonor hokum mozin sola fore, ar ãttu o šena okkol ase. Zodi ãi ekzonore 'Za,' hoi hite za. Ar ekzonore 'Ãi,' hen hoile hite aiye. Ar ãr gulamore 'Iyan gor' hen hoile hite hiyan gore."<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Ei hota funi Isaye tajjuf oiye. Ze šob manuš okkol Isar fise fise aišše hitarar uzu firiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare hoir, Israili okkolor butore o eto ḍõr biššaš ãi ar hono šome no deki."</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Šenafotiye defeṛailde hitara górot firizai sadde he šenafotir gulammuwa aram oi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek rari mar lehar fuware zinda goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Hotun bade Isa Nain name ek farar mikka za šuru goijje. Hibar fũwati sahabi okkol edde ek ḍõr mainšor dol o giye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>ar hiba ṭon geiṭor hãsa hãsi aišše, toi ar so heṛe ek mora lašore bargori hoborstanot gãraito loizar. He lašwa aššilde ek mar lehar ek fut, he ma aššilde ekzon rari maya fuwa. Ar hibar fũwati šohorottu bout manuš okkol aššil. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Malik Isaye he rarir mayafuwaware deki beši doya laigge edde hibare hodde, <char style="wj">"No haindis!"</char><verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Tarfore Isaye hãse zai hãiṭṭagan suiye. Ar hãiṭṭa boi loizaoya okkole tiyaiye. Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"He zuwan fuwa, ãi tore hoir: Uṭ!"</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Hen šomot he mora lašwa uṛi boišše edde hite hota howa šuru goijje. Toi Isaye hitare hitar mar hatot tulidiye.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Hetunot beggunor dilot Allar ḍor góille edde Allar tarif gori howa šuru goijje. "Ãrar maze ekzon moha nobi uiṭṭe, ar Allaye hibar bonda okkolor uzu mon diye!" <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Bade šara Ehudiya edde hiyanor sairo mikkar elehat Isar hanḍor babute sorai giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar hãse Yahyar šagirit okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Yahyar šagirit okkole ei šob goṭona beggun Yahyare funaiye. Ar Yahyaye duizon šagiritore ḍaikke, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>edde hitarare Malik Isar hãse fusar goitto defeṛaiye, "Ze aibar hota, he zon ki õne, naki ãra oinno zonolla entezarot takiyum?"<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Toi hitara Isar hãse zaiyore hodde, "Torikotor gusol doya Yahyaye ãrare õnor hãse defeṛaiye, 'Ze aibar hota he zon ki õne, naki ãra oinno zonor entezarot takiyum?'"<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>He šomot Isaye bout manuš okkolore biyaram, hošto edde bod ruh, in okkolottu hitarare aram goijje. Hibaye aro bout anda mainšor sukore bala gori diye. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Isaye Yahyar šagirit dunizonore endilla zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zo, zin deikko edde fuinno he hóbor Yahyare hogoi: Andaye deker, lenge aṛer, kurus biyaraimma pak saf or, nafange funer, mora uṛi zargoi, edde gorib okkololla bala hóbor tobolig gora or.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Ar mubarok hite, ze ãr zoriya ujaṭ hái fori no zagoi"</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Yahyar hoborguwa okkol zaigoi bade, hibaye manuš okkolore Yahyar babute howa šuru goijje: <char style="wj">"Tũwara bošoti sara elehat ki saito gilade? Boyare lorede hóir ne?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/><char style="wj">No oile, ki saito gilade? Šundor hor findda ekzon manušore ne? So, dami hor finde edde zak zomok loi zibon haṛa, hitara mehelot take.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/><char style="wj">Toile ki saito gilade? Ki ekzon nobi re? Oi, ãi tũwarare hoir, ekzon nobittuwaro beši! </char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><char style="wj">Iba oilde hiba zar babute kitabot leka ase:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">"'Sa, ãi tor age ãr hóborguware defeṛair,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">hite tor age zai tolla fõt saf goribo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, narittu zormo oiyede hitarar maze, Yahyattuwaro mohan kiye nai; tarfore o Allar raijjot ze šobsaite beši šoṛo, hite o hibattuwaro mohan."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>(Ar šomosto manuš okkol edde hazna adaigoroya okkole ei hota funi Allah niyaiban hoi kobul goijje, kiyollahoile hitara Yahyar hãsottu torikotor gusol loiye, <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>kintu Foroši edde dórmiyo alem okkole Yahyar hãsottu torikotor gusol no lowat hitara nizor šommonde Allar eredare befol goijje.)<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Henoile ei zobanar manuš okkolore ãi har loi tulona goijjum? Hitara honḍoilla?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/><char style="wj">Hitara en fuwaindor ḍoilla zara bazarot boi ekzone ar ekzonore ḍakiyore hodde:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">"'Ãra tũwaralla baši bazailam,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">kintu tũwara no nasila.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">Ãra dukkor gan gailam,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">kintu tũwara no handila.'</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>
    <char style="wj">Kiyollahoile torikotor gusoldoya Yahya aišše, edde hite ruṭi ba ãnguror roš no har, ar tũwara hor, 'Hitare bute faiye.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/><char style="wj">Ar Adomor Fut ai há fiya gorer buli tũwara hor: 'So, ei manušwa hánar lalsi bonda edde šorafkur, ar hazna adaigoroya mainšor bondu.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/><char style="wj">Kintu Allar giyanor butore ze za hitar zibone forman gore ze Allar giyan soiyi."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek gunagar mayafuwar guna maf gori diye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Ekzon forošiye hitar górot Isare hánar dawat diye. Hetunot Isa he forošir górot giye edde hána haito boišše. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Ehon, he šohorot ek gunagar maya fuwa aššil. Hibaye Isa he forošir górot hána hadde zani fariyore ek dola fattoror boyomot gori kušbo tel loi hiba heṛe aišše. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Bade hibaye Isar fis ḍakottu ṭengor hãse zai tiyaiye edde hainde. Tarfore sukor fani loi, Isar ṭengor fata bizai diye edde hibar matar sul loi hin fũsi loiye. Tarfore hibaye Isar ṭengor fatat suma diye edde kušbo tel maki diye.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Toi ze forošiye Isare dawat dil hite ei abosta deki mone mone hodde, "Ei manušwa zodi nobi oito toile zani farito, iba hon ḍoilla maya fuwaye suwer, kiyollahoile hiba ekzon gunagar maya fuwa."<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Hetunot Isaye he forošire hodde, <char style="wj">"Simon, ãttu tore kissu hoibar ase."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Hite hodde, "Ustad, ho na."<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ekzon ṭĩya udar doyattu duizon mainše hozzo loiye. Ekzone hozzo loiye fãs šot ṭĩya, ar ekzone fõnzaš ṭĩya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/><char style="wj">Kintu hitarar he hozzo fuzibar ra no takone, ṭĩya udar doyaye hitara dunizonor hozzogun maf gori diye. Ehon, itarar butore hone he ṭĩya udar doyare beši muhabbot goribo?"</char><verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simone hodde, "Zar beši hozzo maf oiye, hite boli mone gori ãi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tui ṭik hoiyos."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Toi Isaye he mayafuwawar uzu firiyore Simonore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ei mayafuwaware dehor ne? Ãi tor górot golilam, tui ãre ṭeng dúibolla fani no dos, kintu ibaye sukor fani di ãr ṭeng bizaiye edde nizor sul loi hin fũsi loiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/><char style="wj">Tui ãre suma di solam no goros, kintu zehon loti ãi butore aišši, hibaye ãr ṭengor fatat suma diyat roiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/><char style="wj">Tui tel di ãr matat maki no dos, kintu hibaye kušbo tel ãr ṭengot maki diye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/><char style="wj">Hetolla ãi tore hoir, Hibaye beši guna gorile o hibar guna maf gora oiye, ar etolla hibaye beši muhabbot dehaiye. Kintu zare olfo maf gora za, hite olfo muhabbot deha."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Bade Isaye he mayafuware hodde, <char style="wj">"Tor guna maf gora oiye."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Zara Isar fũwati hána haito boiššil hitara hitara howa hoi gora šuru goijje, "Iba honnuwa ze guna udda maf gori de?"<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Isaye hetunot he mayafuwaware hodde, <char style="wj">"Tor imane tore uddar goijje, šanti gori zagoi."</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Maya fuwain okkol Isar sahabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Tarfore Isaye elan goribolla edde Allar raijjor mutallek kušir hóbor tobolig goribolla fara fara, šohore šohore gura šuru goijje. Ar fũwati he barozon sahabi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>edde zara bod ruhuttu uddar faiye, biyaramottu aram faiye hendilla hoekzon mayafuwain o fũwati aššil. Hitarar butore aššilde: Moriyam zare Mogdaleni hoi o ḍakito edde zar butottu hãttuwa bod ruh niyoli gilgoi. <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Joana ze badša Herudor menezar Kusar bou. Susanna edde aro bout mayafuwain okkol. Hitarar nizor šombottittu Isa edde he barozon sahabi okkolore solaito.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekzon bizor dana lagoyar kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Ar zẽtte beša beši manuš okkol bout šohor okkolottu aiyore Isar hãse ai birgorer. Toi Isaye hitarare šikka dibolla ei kahanigan hoiye: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/><char style="wj">"Ekzon sašaye hitar bizor dana šiṛibolla giye. Biz šiṛibar šomot hodun biz fõtor kinare foijje, hin manušor fortole oiye edde faik okkole hái felaiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/><char style="wj">Ar hodun biz šil meṛir uwore foijje edde hin heṛe fuiṭṭe, kintu fanir obafe saragun fuwai gilgoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/><char style="wj">Abar hodun biz keṛarzaliwala zagat foijje, he saragun keṛarzalir fũwati bari uiṭṭe, edde hinore keṛarzaliye sibi dori raikke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/><char style="wj">Abar hodun biz bala zobinot foijje, hin bari uiṭṭe edde ek šot gun gula diye."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Ei kahanigan hoi bade Isaye zur gola loi hodde, <char style="wj">"Zar han ase hite funok!"</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Hibar sahabi okkole ei mesal kahaniganor mani ki fusar goijje. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Allar raijjor gufon soiyi tũwarare zainto diya oiye, kintu hitarar hãse kahanir mesale howa oiye, zene,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">"'Hitara deke kintu no deke,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">ar fune kintu no buze.' </char><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ei mesal kahaniganor mani oilde endilla: Biz oilde Allar kalam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/><char style="wj">Fõtor kinare foijjede bizor mesal hitarare diya oiye, zara kalam fune, kintu Šoitane ai hitarar dilottu hiyan tuli loi zagoi. Henot hitara ar hiyanor uwore iman ani no fare boli uddar oi no fare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/><char style="wj">Šil meṛit foijjede bizor mesal hitarare diya oiye, ze he kalam fune edde kuširsate mani lo, kintu hitarattu hiyanor hono šiyõr nai; hitara olfo dinolla biššaš gore, ar forikkar šomot hitara fissa fori zagoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/><char style="wj">Keṛarzaliwala zagat foijjede bizor mesal hitarare diya oiye, zara kalam fune kintu zibon fõtot soilte soilte, šongšari sinta bafona, dón šombotti edde aram aiyešor maze hin sibot fori zagoi, hetolla zibonot hono fona fól deha no de.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/><char style="wj">Bala zobinot foijjede bizor mesal hitarare diya oiye ze soiyi šorol mone he kalam fune, edde mojbut gori kolobor butore dori rake ar hitarar sobori zibonot fona fól dore.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deššir nise serag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar serag zali honokiye dešši loi guri no rake otóba haṭor tole no rake, kintu serag boiṛonir uwore rake, zene zara butore za, hitara fohor deki fare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/><char style="wj">Henot en gufon kissu no takibo zin forhaš no oibo otóba en sufaiya kissu no takibo zin zana no zaibo ba deha no zaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Hetolla tũwara hondilla gori funor he babute diyan do, kiyollahoile zattu ase hitare aro diya oibo. Ar zattu nai hite hitattu zin ase boli mone gore, hin o hitattu loifela oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosi loi zarar asol egenafoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Ar Isar ma edde báiboinain okkole Isare saito aišše. Kintu hitara mainšor zamilalla buli Isa loi deha gori no faijjil. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Bade ekzone Isare hodde: "Õnor ma báiboinain okkole baire tiyai taikke, õne loi deha goitto sar."<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Kintu hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Itara zara Allar kalam fune edde he bafe falon gore, hitara oilde ãr ma edde báiboinain."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye tuwan tamaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Ek din Isa edde Isar sahabi okkol ekkan not uiṭṭe. Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Solo, ãra doriyar ofarot zai."</char> Toi hitara no sajje, <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>edde hitara šor tulidi no solat maze Isa gumot fori giyegoi. Ar doriyat en tuwan oiye, henot hitarar nogan faniye furaiya owa šuru goijje. Henot hitara beša beši bifodot fori giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Hitara Isar hãse zai Isare gumottu tulidi hodde, "Malik, Malik ãra ḍufizairgoi!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Hetunot Isa uṛi boyarore edde goirore dõk diye, ar boyar edde goir hanta oiye, hár kissu nirol oi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Tarfore Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarar biššaš hoṛe?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Kintu hitara ḍore ammuwak oiye edde ekzonore ekzone hodde: "Iba honnuwa? Hibaye boyar edde doriyare hokum gore, ar hitara hibar hota mane!"<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye horaf zine faiya manušore aram goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Tarfore hitara Geraseni okkolor dešot no loi fõisse, ziyan Galilor dusora faror mikka. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Ar Isa zẽtte farot laimme he šohoror ekzon bod ruhuye faiya manuš loi deha oiye. Bout dinottu loti ei manušwaye hor no finder edde górot no taker, kintu hoboror gãtot taker. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Hite Isar sarme meṛit uite fori guzori hodde: "Oh Isa, šoktiwala Allar Fut, ãlloi õnor ki tallukat? Õnor hãse ãi foriyad gorir, ãre zontrona no diyo!" <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Isaye he napak ruhure manušwar butottu niyoli zaito hokum dilde hetolla hite hen goijje. Ei ruhuye bout din oite he manušware doijje. Ar hitare siyol edde beri loi bandi rakile o hite siyol siri bod ruhor kemotaye nirzon zagat zaitogoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Isaye hitare fusar goredde, <char style="wj">"Tor nam ki?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Hite hodde, "Bahani" kiyollahoile hitar butore bout bod ruh okkol aššil. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Tarfore hitarare aṭai gãtot no defeṛaibolla Isare foriyad gora šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Heṛe faharor uwore ḍõr ek šuworor zak soredde aššil, he napak ruhugune Isare foriyad goijje šuworgunor butore hitarare goilto ezajot dibolla, ar hibaye hitarare ezajot diye. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Toi bod ruh okkole he manušwar butottu niyoli zai šuworgunor butore góillegoi. Henot he šuworor zakgun zure dũri faharor haindat giye edde henttu fori fori fanit dufi moijje.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Zara šuworor zak sorail hitara ei hanḍo deki henttu dai giyegoi. Ar ei goṭonaganore he šohorot edde farar hár zagat zai hoiyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Ki oiye hin saibolla hetunot manuš okkol niyoli aišše. Hitara Isar hãse ai dekedde, ze manušwar butottu bod ruh niyoli giyegoi, hite hor findi šuida oi Isar ṭengor ḍake boi taikke, hen deki manuš okkole ḍoraiye. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Zara he goṭonagan dekkil, hitara he bod ruye faiya manušwa ki bafe aram oil hin manuš okkolore hoiye. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Toi Geraseni elehar sairo mikkar šomosto manuš okkole Isare beši ḍoraiye hetolla hitara beggune Isare henttu zaiboilla foriyad goijje. Toi Isaye uiṭṭe edde henttu uwafes firi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Ze manušwattu bod ruh niyoli gilgoi, hite Isar fũwati zai faribo ne fusar goijje. <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>Kintu Isaye hitare en hoi bidai diye, <char style="wj">"Tui tor górot zagoi edde tolla ze ḍõr ham Allaye goijje, hin mainšore hogoi."</char> Henot hite farat firi giyegoi edde Isaye hitalla ze ḍõr ham goijje hin šohoror agagura hoiye.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek mora zerfuwa edde ek biyaraimma maya fuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Isa zẽtte firi aišše manuš okkole hibare kuši mone goisse, kiyollahoile hitara beggune hiballa entezar gori aššil. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ar so, Zairus name ekzon manuš, Isar sarme aišše. Hite aššilde muzolišhanar ekzon neta. Hite Isar fot fori hitar górot zaibolla Isare foriyad gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Kiyollahoile hitattu lehar ek zi aššil, boyoš hom beši baro bosor, ar hiba morar mukot.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Isa heṛe zadde šomot manuš okkole hibare har ḍakottu ṭelaṭeli goijje. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Heṛe butore ekzon beṛi maya fuwa aššil ze baro bosorfan kunzari biyaram loi duk fat ase. Ḍaktor okkolor fise har šombotti beggunore horos gori felai bade o honokiye hibare bala gori no fare. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Hibaye Isar fisottu zai Isar horor kuna suiye. Toi hehon hibar kunzari bon oi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãre hone suiye?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Kintu beggune ošikar goijje. Fitore hodde, "Huzur, mainše har ḍakottu ṭelaṭeliye zafdiforer."<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãre hono ekzone suiye, ãi ṭer faiyi ãr butottu šokti giyede."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mayafuwawaye dekedde hiba luwai tai no faribo, hetunot hiba hafi hafi Isar munttu aišše. Hibaye Isar sarme uite fori kiyolla Isare suiye edde kibafe hehon hibar kunzari bon oiye, in okkol har manušor sarme hibaye hoi funaiye. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Oh zi, tor biššaše tore bala goijje, arame górot firi zagoi."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Isa ehon o hota howat ase, hen šomot muzolišhanar netar górottu ekzon manuš aiyore hodde, "Tũwar zi mori giyoi. Huzurore loi ar diddari no goris."<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Ei hota funiyore Isaye Zairusore hodde, <char style="wj">"No ḍorais, bolke biššaš gor, henot hiba aram oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Bade Isa zehon Zairusor górot fõisse, Fitor, Yakub, Yuhanna edde he zerfuwar babma sara ar honokiyore Isaye góror butore golito no de. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Beggune hiballa handahaṛi edde bilag gorer kintu Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"No haindo! Hiba no more, gum zadde."</char><verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Hitara hen funi Isare ṭaṭṭa uraiye, kiyollahoile hiba mori giyegoide hiyan hitara zainto. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Kintu Isaye hibar hat dori ḍaki hodde, <char style="wj">"Oh zi, uṭ!"</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Henot hibar foran firi aišše edde hiba hehon uṛi tiyaiye. Ar Isaye hibare kissu haito dito hoiye. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Henot hibar babma ekkubare ammuwak oi giyegoi, kintu Isaye hitarare ei goṭonar hotagan honokiyore no hoibolla mana goijje.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Asab okkolore tobolig goitto defeṛar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Bade he barozon asabore ekottoro gori ḍaikke edde hibaye hitarare har bod ruhor uwore edde biyaram bala goribolla šokti edde kemota diye. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Ar Allar raijjor tobolig goribolla edde biyaram aram goribolla Isaye hitarare faṭai diye. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara fõtolla kissu no loiyo, laṛi otóba gaṭṭi, hána otóba ṭĩya kissu no loiyo. Findibar fušak o dui zura no loiyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/><char style="wj">Ar tũwara ze górot zo, he fara sari no zogoi foijjonto he górot taikko.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><char style="wj">Zodi mainše tũwarare no gose, he šohor sari zaibar šomot tũwarar ṭengor tolar dul zari felaiyo, zene hine hitarar berudde goba oi tiya."</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Toi sahabi okkol henttu giyegoi edde fara fara zai Allar raijjor kušir hóbor tobolig goijje edde biyaramma okkolore aram goijje.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Badša Herud edde Isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Badša Herude Isaye zin zin gorer hin beggun fuinne kintu hite honnan biššaš goribo buzi uṛi no fajjil. Kiyollabulihoile kiye kiye hoito Yahya mora okkolor butottu uṛi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Ar kiye kiye hoito Eliyase deha diye, ar kiye kiye hoito, furan hailla nobi okkolor butottu ekzon zinda oi uiṭṭe. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Ar Herude hodde, "Ãi to Yahyar mata haṛi felailam, kintu iba honnuwa zar babute endilla hota funazar." Hetolla badša Herude Isare saibolla kušiš goijje.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye fãs hazar manušore hána diye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Bade asab okkole zin zin goijje, firi aiyore hitara hinore kulasagori Isare zanaiye. Tarfore Isaye hitarare fũwati loi Betsaida farar ḍake ek nizam zagat giye. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Kintu mainše he hóbor zani fariyore hitara Isar fisa loiye. Toi Isaye hitarare rahamotor sãte goisse edde hitarar hãse Allar raijjor babute hota hoiye. Ar zara aram oibar dorhar aššil hitarare aram goijje.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Tarfore din šeš oi aišše, ar he barozon asabe Isar hãse zai hodde: "Õne ei manuš okkolore bidai do, zene itara sairo mikka farat, geramot zai rait haṛai fare edde hána fani tuwai loi fare, kiyollahoile ãra aside zagagan kissu naide zaga."<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Kintu Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara hitarare hána do!"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Asab okkole hodde, "Fãswa ruṭi edde duwa mas sara ãrar hãse ar kissu nai. Ar ki ãra zai edun manušolla haiddo kini ani faijjum?" <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(Heṛe onumanik fãs hazar furuš manuš aššil.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Hetunot Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Itara beggunore fõnzašzon fõnzašzon grup gori buwai do."</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Sahabi okkole hen goijje, beggunore buwai diye. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Tarfore Isaye he fãswa ruṭi edde duwa mas loi asmanor uzu suk tuli hinolla Allare šukuriya zanaiye edde hinore bangi sahabi okkolore diye, mainšore baṛi dibolla. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Toi beggune feṭbori hána háiye. Tarfore hitara zin hái bade guragara basi roiye hinore dola gori baro barang hána oiye.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitore Isare Allar Mosi šikar gorer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Isaye ek bar ekela munazat goredde šomot sahabi okkol o hibar fũwati heṛe aššil. Isaye hitarare fusar goredde: <char style="wj">"Ãi honnuwa, ei babute mainše ki ho?"</char><verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Hitara zuwab diye, "Torikotor gusol doya Yahya, kintu kiye kiye ho nobi Eliyas, ar kiye, beši agor nobi okkolor butottu ek nobi uṛigiyegoi."<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Isaye hitarare fusar goredde: <char style="wj">"Kintu tũwara ki ho, ãi honnuwa?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Fitore hodde, "Õne Allar he Mosi."<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare ei hota honokiyore no hoibolla hũšiyari diye edde mana goijje. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Adomor Futottu beši duk buggora foribo. Ar murobbi okkol, ḍõr imam edde alem okkole hibare batil goribo edde mari felaibo. Ar tin dinor din hibattu morattu uṛizagoi foribo."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar fise lowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Toi hibaye beggunore hodde: <char style="wj">"Honokiye zodi ãr fise aito issa gore, hite nizore ošikar gorok edde hite fotti din nizor duk hoštore bordaš gori ãr fise fise aiyok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ze honokiye hitar nizor foran basaito sa, hite hiyan haraibo. Kintu ze honokiye ãlla boli hitar nizor foran hara, hite hiyan basaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/><char style="wj">Hitar ki lab oiye, zodi šara duniyai hama, kintu nizore harai fele otóba nošto gori fele?</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ze honokiye ãre edde ãr kalamore mainšor munttu šorome ošikar gore. Adomor Fut zehon nizor, edde fobitro firista okkol edde Bafor tozolli loi aibo, hẽtte hibaye o he manuš okkolore ošikar goribo.</char><verse eid="LUK 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, eṛe tũwarar butore en hozon ase zara Allar raijjo no deke foijjonto hitara hono mote moutor fiyala no fibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosir ruf</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Moti 17:1–8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mark 9:2–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>In okkol hoi ek hafta bade, Isaye munazat goribolla Fitor, Yuhanna, Yakub, itarare loi ek faharor uwore giye. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Munazat goribar šomot Isar mukor siyara bodoli giyegoi edde hibar fušak ujjol dola oi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Ar so, duizon manuš, Musa edde Eliyas, hitara Isa loi hota howa šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Hitara keramoti zak zomok loi deha diye edde Zeruzalemot Isaye ze moutor muamui oito zar, hitara he befare hotabatra hoiye. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>He šomot Fitor edde hitar sãti okkol bári gumot aššil. Hitara seton oi Isar keramot edde oi duizon manuš zara Isar fũwati tiyai taikke hitarare deikke. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>He duizon Isar hãsottu zargoide šomot Isare Fitore hodde: "Huzur, ãra eṛe aside bala oiye. Ãra tinnan bãša banai, ekkan õnolla, ekkan Musalla, ar ekkan Eliyasolla." (Kintu Fitore asole ki hor hin hite nize o no zane.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Fitore hen hodde šomot ekkan miyula ai hitarar uwore saiya oiye. Hitara zẽtte miyular butore oiye, hẽtte hitara beši ḍoraiye. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Ar he miyular butottu endilla ek abaz funa giye, "Iba ãr fut, he basai gora, hibar hota fuinno." <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Abaz oi mottor Isare ekela deha giye. Ar hitara suf gori taikke, zin zin sahabi okkole dekkil hin he šomot honokiyore no ho.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye ek bute faiya fuware aram goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Moti 17:14–18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-20">Mark 9:14–20</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 9:25-27">25–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Tarfordin zehon hitara he faharottu lami aišše, bout mainše Isa loi deha goijje. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Ar so, zamor butottu ekzone guzori hodde, "Huzur, aroz gorir, ãr fuwawar uzu suk tuli so, kiyollahoile ite šude ãr lehar ek fut. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>So, ek ruhuye itare hamela gorer, ar atikka kiskisai uṛe. He ruhuye itare musori dore, henot ite muk bai fena bair gore, ar ruhuye itare zal zal gori kub hošto di erizagoi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ãi õnor sahabi okkolore foriyad goijjilam, zene hitara ibare sarai de, kintu hitara no fare."<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Toi Isaye zuwabe hodde: <char style="wj">"Oh obiššaši edde bonḍor dol! Ar hotokal ãi tũwarar fũwati takiyum edde tũwarare bordaš goriyum? Tor futore loi eṛe ai!"</char><verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>He fuwawa aiyerde hen šomot oi bod ruhuye hitare felai diye edde hora gori musori doijje. Kintu Isaye he napak ruhure dõk diyore fuwaware aram goijje. Toi hitare bafor hãse firai diye. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Henot beggune Allar he mohimar šokti deki tajjuf oiye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Isaye abar nizor motor babute hor</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Moti 17:22–23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mark 9:30–32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Toi hár manuš okkol Isaye goijjede hamot tajjuf oiyede šomot, Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/><char style="wj">"Tũwara ei šob hota mon di funo! Kiyollahoile Adomor Futore manuš okkolor hatot tuli diya oibo."</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Kintu hitara he hota buzi no fare, edde he hotar mani hitarattu gufon raka oiye, zenneki hitara buzi uṛi no fare, ar he babute Isattu fusar goitte o hitara ḍoraiye.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍõr hone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Moti 18:1–5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mark 9:33–37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Sahabi okkol hone beggunottuwaro ḍõr hiyan loi hitarar butore hota haṛa haṛi oiye. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Isaye hitarar monor baf buzi fariyore ek gura fuware loi hibar ḍake tiyagoraiye. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Toi sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ze honokiye ãr name ei gura fuwaware gose, hite ãre gose. Ar ze honokiye ãre gose, hite hibare gose ze ãre defeṛaiye. Kiyollahoile ze tũwarar butore beggunottuwaro šoṛo, hite oilde dõr."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Bade Yuhannaye hodde, "Ustad, õnor name ekzon mainše but saradde dekkilam, hite ãrar dolot node hetolla buli ãra hitare mana goijjilam."<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Kintu Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara hitare mana no goijjo! Kiyollahoile ze tũwarar bifokke no hitede tũwarar fokke ase."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sameriya farar mainše Isare no gose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Ar zehon Isare uwore tuli loi zaibar ṭaim hãse aišše, hetunot Isa Zeruzalemor mikka zaibolla ek mone ereda gori felaiye. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Ar Isaye zaibar age hóborguwa okkolore defeṛaiye. Ar hitara zai Sameri okkolor farat góille, Isalla entezam gori farefan. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Isaye Zeruzalem zaibo ereda goijje buli heṛiyar manuš okkole Isare no gose. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Hendilla deki Isar sahabi Yakub edde Yuhannaye fusar goredde, "Malik, õne ki issa goro, Eliyase zendilla goijje hendilla ãra hoi, asmanottu oin lami ai itarare dongšo gori felok?" <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar mikka muk firai dõk diye edde hodde, tũwara no zano ne, tũwarare hon ruh loi banaiye? Adomor Futore manušor zibon dongšo goribolla faṭa oiyede no, kintu uddar goribolla. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Tarfore hitara oinno ekkan farat giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare manile dam diya fore</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Moti 8:19–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Hitara fõt bai zadde hen šomot ekzon manuše Isare hodde, "Õne zeṛe zo ãi o õnor fũwati heṛe zaiyum."<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Šiyal okkolottu gãt ase edde asmanor faikottu baha ase, kintu Adomor Fute mata rakibar hono zaga nai."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Isaye ar ekzonore hodde: <char style="wj">"Ãr fisa lo."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kintu hite hodde: "Huzur, age ãr bafore dohon gorai aito do."<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Isaye hitare hodde: <char style="wj">"Mora okkole mora okkolore dohon gora ok, kintu tui zai Allar raijjor tobolig gor."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Ar ekzone Isare hodde, "Malik, ãi õnor fisa loiyum, kintu age ãre ãr góror manuš okkolottu bidai loi aito do."<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ze honokiye naholor kuṛi dori fis mikka firisa hite Allar raijjor laikka oi no fare."</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Hoittor duizonore toboligot defeṛaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Hiyar bade Malik Isaye aro oinno hoittor duizonor mainšore basona goijje. Ar Isa nize ze ze šohor ba fara okkolot zaibolla ereda goijje, he šomosto zaga edde šohorot hiba zaibar age duizon duizon gori hitarare defeṛaiye. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Hãsa, dán beši foille kintu dán daoya manuš hom. Etolla danor malikor hãse foriyad goro zene malike hibar dán daibolla manuš faṭai de.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><char style="wj">Tũwara zo! Ãi tũwarare sool hisabe genḍa bagor okkolor butore defeṛair.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><char style="wj">Ṭiyar beg, hoilla ba ṭengor šendal fũwati no loiyo, edde fõtot honokiyor loi mulot oibolla no tiyaiyo.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu tũwara ze górot goliba, heṛe tũwara foila hoiba, 'Ei górot šanti aiyok.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Zodi heṛe šantir manuš take henoile tũwarar šanti hitar uwore ziraibo. Ar zodi hendilla honokiye no take hentoile tũwarar šanti tũwarar hãse firi aibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><char style="wj">Ar he górot taikko edde hitara zin há fiya gorito de hin haiyo, kiyollahoile ze ham gore hite beton faibar laikka. Ek gór sari ar ek górot no zaiyogoi.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zodi hono farat zo edde heṛeiyar manuš okkole tũwarare gose toile hitara tũwarare zin de hin haiyo! </char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/><char style="wj">He farar biyaraimma okkolore aram goijjo edde hoiba, 'Allar raijjo tũwarar hãse aišše.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><char style="wj">Kintu zodi hono farat zo edde heṛiyar mainše tũwarare no gose, he farar rasta rasta zai en hoiba,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/><char style="wj">'Tũwarar farar ze dul ãrar ṭengot boijje hin o ãra zari felailam, tarfore o tũwara zani rako ze Allar raijjo hãse aišše.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, bisaror din he farattuwaro Súdum šohoror doša šowa zaibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <char style="wj">"Korasin šohor tor bifod! Betsaida šohor tor bifod! Ze šob keramot tũwarar butore gora oiye, hin okkol zodi Tiros edde Sidon šohorot gora oito, toile hitara bout din age salar šoṭ findi saiyot boi gunattu mon firaito.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/><char style="wj">Kintu bisaror din tũwarar došattuwaro Tiros edde Sidon šohoror doša šowa zaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Ar tui Kofornahum šohor, tũi bole ki asman uwore uṛibi? Honodin oi no fare, tore meṛir nise fatalfurot feli diya oibo!</char><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zara tũwarar hota fune hitara ãr hota fune. Zara tũwarare hela gore, hitara ãre hela gore. Kintu zara ãre hela gore, hitara ãre ze defeṛaiye hibare hela gore."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">He hoittor duizon kušir sãte firi aišše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>He hoittor duizon ummote kušir sãte firi aišše edde hodde: "Malik, õnor nam dorile bod ruh okkole foijjonto ãrar hota fune!"<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi Šoitanore asmanottu bizoli somkefana gori nise foredde dekki.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><char style="wj">So, ãi tũwarare haf edde bissure ṭenge fiši maribolla edde dušmon Šoitanor har šokti loi ziti faribolla šokti diyi. Hono kissuye tũwarare hoti gori no faribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/><char style="wj">Kintu bod ruhuye tũwarar hota fune boli kuši no goijjo bolke behostot tũwarar nam leka oiye boli kuši goro."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Hetunot Isaye Pak Ruhur kušiye ullaš oi hodde, <char style="wj">"Ya Baf, tũi asman edde duniyair malik, ãi tũware šukuriya zanai, kiyollahoile ei hota okkol tũi giyani edde buddiman okkolottu lukairaki masum gura fuwaindor hãse forhaš goijjo. Oi, Baf, iyan tũwar bala issa.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãr Bafe ãr hatot hár kissu diye. Baf sara ar honokiye no zane Fuwa honnuwade hiyan, ar Fuwa sara honokiye no zane Baf honnuwade hiyan. Ar Fuwaye zar hãse Bafore forhaš goitto sa šude hite zane."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Toi hitara zehon ekela oiye, hibaye hitarar mikka firiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Rahamot ok he suk okkolor uwore, tũwara dekodde hin zara deker.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir: Tũwara dekorde hin bout nobi okkole edde badša okkole saito issa goijje kintu saibolla no fa, ar funito issa goijje kintu funito no fa."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek Sameriyar rahamoti manušor kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Ar so, ekzon dórmiyo aleme Isare forikka gori saibolla hibar hãse aiyore hodde, "Huzur, akeri zibonor odihar faite ãttu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ainot ki leka ase? Heṛe hondilla foijjo?"</char><verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>He hite hodde: "'Tũi tũwar šomosto dil, šomosto mon, šomosto foran, šomosto šokti, diyore Allah Mabudore muhabbot goro. Ar tũwar ḍen gór bam gójjare nizor zani muhabbot goro.'"<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Isaye hitare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũi ṭik zuwab diyo. Zodi tũi he mozin gorat tako, toi tũi o zibon faiba."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>He aleme hitar nizor šorman basaibolla Isare abar hodde, "Bala, ãr ḍen gór bam gójja hontara?"<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Zuwabe Isaye endilla hoiye: <char style="wj">"Ekzon manuš Zeruzalemottu fõt bai lami Zeriku šohorot zar, hen šomot hite ḍahaitor hatot foijje. Ḍahait okkole hitar findonor hoorgun kuli loi felaiye edde hitare mari ada mora abostat raki giyegoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Goṭona sokkore ekzon imam o he fõt bai lami aišše. Hite he manušware deki rasta fašhaṛi gilgoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/><char style="wj">Bade hendilla ekzon dórmogór šasiyot goroya Levi o he zagat ai manušware deki, hite o fašhaṛi giyegoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><char style="wj">Tarbade Sameriya elehar ekzon manuš, zarare šomazot niroš zat hisabe gona oito, he fõt bai zaite zaite oi manušwar hãsa hãsi aišše. Hitare deki tattu doya laigge,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/><char style="wj">edde hitar ḍake zai, hitar gá okkolot tel edde ãnguror roš ḍalidi hinore bandi diye. Tarfore hitar nizor zanuwaror uwore buwai ek šoraihanat loigiye edde hitare šeba zotton goijje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/><char style="wj">Tarfordin he Sameriyar manušwaye duiyan dinar šoraihanar menezarore diyore hodde, 'Ei manušwar adorhatir goriba, beši za kissu horos o, hin ãi abar aile šud gori diyum.'</char><verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ehon tũwattu ki mone o? Ei tinzonor maze hone he ḍahaitor hatot fora manušwar ḍen gór bam gójja?"</char><verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>He aleme zuwabe hodde, "Ze manušwaye hitare ador hatir goijje hite."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Toi Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile tũi o zo he mozin gorogoi."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Martá edde hibar boin Moriyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Ar hitara zadde šomot Isaye hono ek farat góille, heṛe Martá name ek maya fuwaye hibar górot Isare meheman hisabe goisse. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Moriyam name ekzon hibattu boin aššil. Hibaye Malik Isar ṭengor ḍake ai boi Isar hota funer. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Kintu Martá góror harz harbare beši duwadit aššil. Hibaye hitara dunizonor hãse aiyore hodde: "Malik õne ki kissu bafi no sor ne, ãr boine ãre beggun halika ga gora diyede? Õne hibare ãre modot gori dito ho!"<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Kintu malik Isaye zuwabe hodde: <char style="wj">"Martá! Tui bout hame duwadit edde sintat.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/><char style="wj">Kintu ekkan šude zoruri ham ase. Moriyame he hamman basi loiye, hetolla hiyan hibattu loi fela no zaibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Isaye sahabi okkolore munazat gora šikar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-15">Moti 6:9–15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Ek šome Isaye hono ek zagat duwa gorer. Duwa gora šeš oi bade Isar sahabi okkolor butottu ekzone Isare hodde: "Malik, Yahyaye zendilla hibar šagirit okkolore duwa gora šikaiye hendilla õne ãrare o duwa gora šikao." <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara duwa goribar šomot endilla ho: </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">"'Ya, ãrar behosti Baf, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Tũwar nam fobitro boli mana ok. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">Tũwar raijjo aiyok.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Fotti dinor haiddo tũi fotti din ãrare do. </char><verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Ãrar har gunare maf gori do, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">zendilla ãra o maf gori hitarare, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">zara ãrar berudde hosuri gore. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">ar ãrare forikkat foitto no diyo.'" </char><verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Tarfore Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Mone goro! Tũwarar butore hono ekzonottu ekzon bondu ase. Ar hite zodi ada raitta hitar bondur hãse zai ho, 'Bondu, ãre tinnwa ruṭi udar do,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/><char style="wj">kiyollahoile ãr ek bondu musafer oi ãr heṛe aišše, hitar munttu ani dibolla ãttu kissu nai.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/><char style="wj">Henoile ki he manušwaye butottu tai en zuwab dibo ne, 'Ãre hošto no diyo, ehon doroza banda, ar ãr fuwain ãr ḍake gum giye. Ãi uṛi tũware kissu di no farir.' </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, hite zodi bondu hisabe uṛi no de, tarfore o hite bar bar foriyad goredde hiyanolla buli oile o hite uṛibo edde hitar zorulot mozin hitare hin dibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>
    <char style="wj">"Etolla ãi tũwarare hoir: Munazatot so, toi tũwarare diya oibo. Tuwo, toi tũwara tuwai faiba. Dorozat ṭulki maro, toi tũwaralla kula oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/><char style="wj">Zara mage hitara to fottizonore diya o, ze tuwa, hite tuwai fa, ar ze dorozat ṭulki de, hitalla doroza kula o.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwarar butore endilla baf hone ase, fuwaye mas magile haf de,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/><char style="wj">otóba ãnḍa magile bissu de?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/><char style="wj">Tũwara zodi horaf oi bade o tũwarar fuwain okkolore uttom uttom ziniš di zano, toile ei hota hoto haṭi ze, zara mage hitarare behostiyo Bafe Pak Ruhure dibo!"</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bod ruh okkolor uwore Isar kemota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Moti 12:22–30</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">43–45</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mark 3:22–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Ar ek bar Isaye ek buk but dafaiye. But zehon bair oigiyegoi, he buk manušwaye hota howa šuru goijje. Henot manuš okkol tajjuf oiye. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Kintu hitarar butore kiye kiye hodde, "Butor raza Belsebulor modote ite but bair gore." <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Ar kiye kiye forikka gori saibolla Isare behostottu ekkan sinno dehaito hoiye.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar monor baf buzi faijje edde hibaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Ze raijjo bag o hiyan dongšo o, ar gór zodi góror bifokke o hiyan dongšo o.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/><char style="wj">Hendilla, Šoitane o zodi hitar nizor berudde ai tiya, toile ken gori hitar raijjo ṭikibo? Ar tũwara hor ãi Belsebulor modote but sarai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/><char style="wj">Ašša! Ãi zodi Belsebulor modote but sarai, toile tũwarar nizor manuš okkole har modote but sara? Tũwara soiyi hor ne hiyan hitara bisar gori sok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/><char style="wj">Kintu ãi zodi Allar kemota loi but sarai, henoile Allar raijjo tũwarar hãse aišše.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ekzon bolwala mainše zodi hár ḍoilla ostro loi nizor gór fahara de, toile hitar mal fottoro nirafodot take.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/><char style="wj">Kintu hitattuwaro bolwala honokiye zodi ai hitar loi zite, toile hite ze ostro okkolor uwore nirbor goijje hin oi manušwaye hari loi felaibo, ar luṛor mallun loi zai bag goribogoi.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi hoir: Zodi honokiye ãr fokke no take toile hitede ãr bifokke roiye, ze ãr fũwati no feṛa hitede šiṛe."</char><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hono napak ruh zehon ekzon manušor butottu bair oi zagoi, hetunot hite aramor zaga tuwaibolla šuwana zagat zai gura fira gore. Bade zodi hite hendilla no fa, hite hode, 'Ãi ze górottu niyoli aiššyi he górot ãi abar firi zaiyumboi.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Firi ai sadde, górgan foriškar edde hãzaiya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/><char style="wj">Hetunot hite zai hitattuwaro aro hãt zon horaf napak ruhure fũwati loi ane edde heṛe goli bošobaš gore. Hiyanolla boli he manušwar doša foila barottuwaro šešor doša aro horaf o."</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Isaye ei šob hota hodde šomot mainšor zamottu hono ek maya fuwaye guzori Isare hodde, "Mubarok he feṭ, ze õnore feṛot loiye edde bukor dud habaiye."<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Kintu Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Iyanottuwaro hitarare mubarak zara Allar kalam fune edde hindilla gore." </char><verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ei halor naforman manuš</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Moti 12:38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Toi aro manuš okkole Isare sairo ḍakottu berai doijje, hetunot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ei halor manuš okkol horaf, hitara sinno tuwa, kintu Yunus nobir sinno bade ar hono sinno hitarare deha no oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Nineveh šohoror manuš okkololla zendilla Yunus nobi nize sinno oil, ṭik hendilla ei halor manuš okkololla o Adomor Fut sinno oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><char style="wj">Bisaror din doin dešor raniye ei halor manuš okkolor fũwati uṛi itarare duši goribo, kiyollahoile hibaye badša Soloimanor giyanor hota funibolla duniyair šeš ḍakottu aiššil. Ar so, eṛe Soloimanottuwaro aro mohan ekzon ase. </char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><char style="wj">Bisaror din Nineveh šohoror manuš okkole ei halor manuš okkolor fũwati uṛi itarare duši goribo, kiyollahoile Yunus nobir toboligor duwara Nineveh šohoror manuš okkole gunattu mon firail. Ar so, eṛe Yunusottuwaro aro mohan ekzon ase.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">suk oilde gar serag</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Moti 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22–23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <char style="wj">"Serag zalai honokiye ũjja góror tole ba laiyor nise no rake, bolke hiyan seragor tokor uwore rake, zene zara butore za hitara fohor deke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/><char style="wj">Suk oilde gar serag, tũwar suk zodi taza o, hin hendilla oiyede haron oilde, gagan fohore furaiyade hetolla. Kintu suk zodi taza no o, hin hendilla oiyede haron oilde, gaganot andar ase.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/><char style="wj">Hetolla so, tũwar butore ze fohor ase hiyan hono andarot ne.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/><char style="wj">Tũwar šara ga zodi fohore furaiya o, edde ekkagori o andar no take, ṭik serag zendilla nizor teze tũware fohor de, hendilla tũwar hara ga furafuri bafe fohore furaiya oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye dórmiyo neta okkolor berudde hor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Moti 23:1–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Isa hota howa šeš gori bade ekzon forošiye Isare hánar dawat diye. Hibaye butore zai hána haito boišše. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Isaye hána háibar age hat no duwede deki forošiwaye ammuwak oiye.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Kintu Malik Isaye hitare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara Foroši okkole fanir fiyala edde deššir bar ḍakottu foriškar goro kintu tũwarar butore lalos edde naformaniye boraiya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/><char style="wj">Murokko manuš okkol! Ze baror ḍak banaiye, hibaye ki butoror ḍak o no bana ne?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/><char style="wj">Bolke deššir butore za za ase hin gorib okkolore dan goro, toi dekiba, beggun tũwaralla foriškar oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwara Foroši okkolore, kiyollahoile tũwara Allare fudina, tez fata edde hár ḍoilla hakor doš bagor ek bag di tako. Kintu niyai bisar edde Allar muhabbotor mikka diyan no do. Foilagan falon goribar fũware fũware dusoragan falon gora o tũwarar dorhari.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwara Foroši okkolore, muzolišhanar mum mikkar zagat boite edde rasta gaṛot ijjot fare muhabbot goro.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwara Foroši okkolore, tũwara en hobor okkolor ḍoilla zinor hono sinno no take, edde no zani mainše heṛe uwottu ãṛe, ar hitara napak o."</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Hetunot dórmo šikoya alem okkolor butottu ekzone Isare hodde, "Huzur, õne ei hota hoi ãrare o ofoman goror."<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwara dórmo šikoya alem okkolore! Tũwara manušor uwore bor fũza tuli do, kintu hitara hin mani farefan modot gori hoi uggwa õl o no laro.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwarare, tũwara nobi okkolor hoborore mazar banao, otoso tũwarar baf dada okkole hitarare kun goijje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/><char style="wj">Iyan deki buza zar ze tũwara tũwarar baf dadar hamot ekmot oiyo, kiyollahoile hitara mari felaiye ar tũwara hitarar hoborore mazar banayo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/><char style="wj">Etolla giyani Allaye Allar kalamot hodde, 'Ãi hitarar hãse nobi okkol edde asab okkolore defeṛaiyum. Hitarar butottu ho ekzonore hitara kun goribo edde ar kissur uwore ottisar goribo.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/><char style="wj">Hetolla duniyair foilar šuru oite šuru gori zetozon nobire kun gora oiye, hitarar louwor dai oibo ei halor manuš okkol.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><char style="wj">Habilor kun oiyede oite šuru gori Zakariya, zare pak zaga edde dórmogóror maza mazi zagat kun gora oiye. Oi, ãi tũwarare hoir, ei halor manuš okkol ei louwor dai oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bifod tũwara dórmo šikoya alem okkololla! Tũwara giyanor sabi nizor hãse raki diyo. Giyanor butore tũwara o no golila, ar zara butore goilto saiye hitarare o tiya garai felaiyo."</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Toi Isaye hentu niyoli zargoide šomot dórmiyo alem okkol edde Foroši okkole mezaz gorom gori bout ḍoilla suwal okkol loi Isar uwore zafai foijje. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Hitara Isare mukor hotat bul doribolla fand buwai raikke.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Bonḍami edde lalsir babute Isar hokum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-33">Moti 10:26–33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Hen šomot hazar hazar manuš en bafe dola oiye, hitara ṭelateli gori ekzone ar ekzonor uwore fora šuru goijje. Hetunot Isaye foila sahabi okkolor uzu firi hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara Foroši okkolor šikkattu hũšiyar, hin tũwarar gat no farafan, kiyollahoile hin bonḍami.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Guijja kissu nai, zin forhaš no oibo, edde gufon kissu nai, zin zana no zaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Otoso tũwara andarot za kissu hoiyo, hin fohorot funa zaibo, edde zin góror butore hane hane ho, hin sador uwottu guzori howa oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>
    <char style="wj">"O ãr bondu okkol, ãi tũwarare hoir, zara ga dongšo gori bade ar kissu gori no fare, hitarare no ḍoraiyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Harare ḍoraiba ãi tũwarare hiyan hoir. Tũwarare mari felai bade jahannamot dibar kemota zattu ase hibare ḍoro. Oi ãi tũwarare hoir, hibare ḍoro.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/><char style="wj">Fãswa fiyajjare ki dui foišaye no bese ne? Tarfore o Allaye hinor uggware o forai no fele.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/><char style="wj">En ki tũwarar matar sullun o Allattu gona ase. No ḍoraiyo, tũwara beši fiyajja okkolottuwaro aro beši dami.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare hoir, ze honokiye manušor šaikkat ãre šikar gore, Adomor Fute o Allar firistar šaikkat hitare šikar goribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/><char style="wj">Kintu ze honokiye ãre manušor šaikkat ošikar gore, Adomor Fute o Allar firistar šaikkat hitare ošikar goribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Adomor Futor berudde honokiye hota hoile, hite maf faibo. Kintu ze honokiye Pak Ruhure hingša gore, hitare maf gora no oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar mainše tũwarare zẽtte sinagogot edde šašon goroyar sarme loi za, hetunot ki zuwab diba ba ki hoiba he babute sinta no goijjo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hetunot ki howa foribo tũwarare Pak Ruhuye šikai dibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">He bekub tuwangor manušwar mesal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Zamilar butottu ekzon manuše Isare hodde: "Huzur, ãr báiyore ãr loi miraz borat goitto ho!"<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Kintu Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Bondu, tũwarar uwore bisarhar ba miraz bag gori doya hoi ãre hone tuille?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Bade Isaye manuš okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Hũšiyar! Har ḍoilla lalsittu nizore basai rako, kiyollahoile ekzon mainšottu zafdi forefan dón šombotti oile o, hine zibon no de."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Ar Isaye hitarare ei mesal kahanigan hoiye, <char style="wj">"Ekzon zomidaror zobinot kethõla beši oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/><char style="wj">Henot hite mone mone sinta gori hodde, 'Ãi ehon ki goijjum? Ãttude hin rakibar zaga nai.'</char><verse eid="LUK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bade hite hodde, 'Ãi endilla goijjum. Ãr gudam górgun bangi felai hinore ḍõr ḍõr gori banaiyum edde ãi ãr kuraffati edde ãr zinišfati okkolore heṛe zoma gori rakiyum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/><char style="wj">Bade ãi nizor foranore hoiyum, foran, tolla bout bosorolla beša beši bala bala zinišfati dola goijja ase, há fiya gor, aram gor, asanot zibon haṛa.'</char><verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu Allaye hitare hodde, 'O bekub, aijja raitta tor foran hori loi zaiboi, toile tui in zinor bondobos goijjos, hin har oibo?'</char><verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ze nizolla dón zoma gore kintu Allar nozdikot dónban no hitalla hendilla oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Allar uwore boroša goro, no ḍoraiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Bade Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde: <char style="wj">"Etolla ãi tũwarare hoir: Ki háiyum hoi foranor babute, otóba ki findiyum hoi gar babute sinta no goijjo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile foran haiddottuwaro ar ga horottuwaro ḍõr ziniš.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/><char style="wj">Hawagunor uzu so, hine no laga, ar no da. Hinottu gudam ba hãijja o nai, to kintu Allaye hitarare o ahar de. Ar tũwara to faikottuwaro bout dami!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Ho sai, tũwarar butore bafa sinta gori hone šude ek gonḍa nizor aiyu barai fariba?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Zehon tũwara hen šoṛo ham o gori no faro, toile baki befare kiyolla sinta goriba?"</char><verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bafi so, full ken gori bare. Hine hono ham o no gore, hor banaibolla fũta o no haṛe. Kintu ãi tũwarare hoir: Badša Soloimane hibar šomosto zak zomokottu o inor ekkanor ḍoilla nizore hãzai no fare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/><char style="wj">Maṛot ze ker ase, zin hailla sulat felai diya oibo, hin zodi Allaye endilla gori hãzai fare, toile oh olfo biššaši okkol! Allaye tũwarare hãzaibode hiyan aro hoto beši haṭi!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/><char style="wj">Ar ki há fiya goriba in loi tũwara no baiffo, sinta no goijjo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/><char style="wj">In okkol to zara Allare biššaš no gore hitara tuwa, kintu tũwarar bafe zane ze tũwarattu in okkolor dorhar ase.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Hinottuwaro bolke Allar raijjor talaš goro, toi in beggun o tũwarare diya oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>
    <char style="wj">"Oh šoṛo dol, no ḍorais! Kiyollahoile tũwarar Bafor bala issa oilde, he raijjore tũwarare diya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/><char style="wj">Tũwarattu zin ase, hin besi horat hisabe dan goro. Ar behostot ofurani dón zoma goro, zeṛe sur o hãse nu aibo, fuk zuke o hoti gori no faribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile zeṛe tũwarar dón, heṛe tũwarar dil o takibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adomor Futolla suk han kula rako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwarar kiyail bandi tiyar tako edde serag zalai rako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><char style="wj">Ar tũwara en mainšor ḍoilla o, zitara hitarar malik biyar melattu firi aiyer ne sai take, zendilla neki malik ai dorozat ṭulki dile, hitara malikore toratori doroza kuli di fare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/><char style="wj">Šuki he gulam okkol, zarare góror malike ai seton dekibo. Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, he malike kiyail bandi hitarare hánar ṭebilot buwaibo edde ḍake zai hitarare luid goribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/><char style="wj">Šuki hitara, zarare góror malike ada raitta ba dolfohor ode hetunot ai o seton dekibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><char style="wj">Kintu iyan buzo: Sur hon šomoi loi aibo hiyan zodi góror malike zainto, toile seton takito, nizor górot šingar dito no dito.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Hetolla tũwara o tiyar tako, kiyollahoile ze šomot mone no goriba, he šomot Adomor Fut aibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Hetunot Fitore fusar goredde, "Malik, ei mesal ki õne ãrare hodde naki beggunore hodde?"<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Malik Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"He biššaši, buddiwala menezar hiba honnuwa, zare hitar malike hibar gulam okkolor uwore buwaibo hitarare ṭãim motabek hána dibolla.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/><char style="wj">Šuki he gulam, zare malike ai hendilla goredde dekibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, hitare he góror malike hár kissur uwore zimma dibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/><char style="wj">Kintu mone goro! He gulame zodi mone mone ho, ãr malik aite aro deri ase hoi gulam edde bandi okkolore mara dora gore edde há fiya gori fól owa šuru gore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/><char style="wj">Ze din Malik aibo hoi ofekka no gore edde ze šomoir hota hite no zane, he dinor he šomot he gulamor malik aibo edde hitare haṛi bag gori obiššaši okkolor fũwati hitar zaga ṭik goribo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>
    <char style="wj">"He gulam ze hitar nizor malikor issa zane, tarfore o hite tiyar no o ba malikor issa mozin no gore hitare beši fiṛa diya zaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/><char style="wj">Kintu ekzone hiyan no zane edde fiṛa faibar ham goijje, hitare hom šaza diya oibo. Zare beši diya oiye, hitattu beši dabi gora oibo, ar mainše zar hãse beši rake, hitattu beši uwafes lo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi duniyait oin zalaito aiššyi. Ar ehon zodi ãi issa goijjilamde mozin he oin zolito! </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><char style="wj">Kintu ãttu dukkor torikotor gusol muwamui owa foribo, ar hiyan furon no o foijjionto ãi hoto sifor butore asi!</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/><char style="wj">Tũwara ki mone goror, ãi ki duniyaire šanti dito aiššyi? Ãi tũwarare hoir, hen no, bolke hiyanor ulda.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/><char style="wj">Ehonottu loti ek góror fãszon aleda oibo, tinzon duizonor bifokke, duizon tinzonor bifokke lagibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><char style="wj">Baf fuwar bifokke, ba fuwa bafor bifokke, ma ziyor bifokke, ba zi mar bifokke, hori bouwor bifokke ba bou horir bifokke lagibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sinnore sinilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Mainšor dolore Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zehon fosimottu miyula uṛede deko, hetunot onegane ho, 'Zór aibo', ar hendilla o.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/><char style="wj">Ar zẽtte doinottu bataš badde deho, hetunot ho, 'Beši roidor gorom oibo,' ar hendilla o.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/><char style="wj">Munafek okkol! Tũwara duniyai edde asmanor baf buzi faro, kintu ei ṭaim buzi no faror, iyan honḍoilla hota?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>
    <char style="wj">"Niyai oinnai tũwara nize bisar gori kiya no sor? </char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/><char style="wj">Zẽtte tũwara bifokkor manušor fũwati bisarharor hãse zo, fõtot maze rehai faibolla kušiš goro, ar no oile hite tũwarare bisarharor hãse ṭani loizaibo. Ar bisarhare fulišor hatot gosai dibo edde fuliše tũware ziyol golai eribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/><char style="wj">Ãi tore hoir: Zetodin šeš foiša foijjonto fũzi no felos, hetodin tui hono mote hentu baire ai no faribi."</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mon fira zorulot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>He šomot hozon manuš Isar heṛe hazir oil. Hitara Galilor kissu mainšor babute Isare howa šuru goijje. Hitara hoiye ze, Filate ei Galilor manuššunore haṛi hitarar kurbanir zanuwaror louwor fũwati itarar louwore mišai felaiye. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Zuwabe Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"He Galilor mainšor uwore endilla durgoti oiye boli ki hitara dusora Galilor manušottuwaro beši gunagar boli mone goro?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, hen no! Bolke tũwara zodi o mon no firo, tũwara beggune o hendilla dongšo oi zaibagoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/><char style="wj">Ar no oile he aṛarozon, zarar matar uwore Šilo guid bangi fori mori gilgoi. Tũwara ki mone goro, hitara ki ar baki Zeruzalemot bošobaš goredde hitarattuwaro beši gunagar aššil? </char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, hen no! Bolke tũwara zodi o mon no firo, tũwara beggune o hendilla dongšo oiba."</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gula sara ḍũir gasor mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Tarfore Isaye ei mesal kahanigan hoiye: <char style="wj">"Ekzon manuš, hitar ãngur ketit uggwa ḍuirgula gas aššil. Hite heṛe ai ḍuirgula tuwail, kintu no fa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Henot hite keti sõloyare hodde, 'Ãi eṛe ei gasot tin bosor mula ailam edde ḍuirgula tuwailam, kintu hono gula fa no za. Iba haṛi felaide! Iba eṛe taiyore kiyolla zobin nošto oito!'</char><verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu keti sõloyaye hodde, 'Huzur, ibare ei bosor o raki do, ãi ibar šiyoror sairo ḍakottu kuri fãš diyum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/><char style="wj">Zodi gula lage toile to bala, ar no oile hiba haṛi felaiyo.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye ek mayafuware aram goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Ek dórmor din Isaye hono ek sinagogot šikka dil. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Ar so, ekzon maya fuwa, zare aṛaro bosorfan ek bod ruhuye kuza gori raikke. Hiba en behã oi gilgoi hono mote uzu oi no farito. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Isaye zehon hibare deikke, toi hibare hãse ḍaikke, ar hodde: <char style="wj">"Oh maya fuwa, tui ošukottu azad oiyos!"</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Hen hoi bade Isaye hãttan hibar uwore raikke. Ar hehon hiba uzu oi tiyai faijje edde hibaye Allar tarif gora šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Kintu Isaye dórmor din aram goijje boli muzolišhanar netaye naraz oiye. Hite manuš okkolore hodde: "So din ase he šob ham goribar. Ar he šomosto din okkolot aiššo edde aram oiyo, dórmor din no!"<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Kintu Malik Isaye hitare zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Munafek okkol! Tũwara fottizone ki dórmor din tũwarar goru sool okkolore urattu kuli fani habaito no loi zo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Toile ei maya fuwa, Ibrahimor šontan, zare Šoitane, so, aijja aṛaro bosor dori bandi raikke, he bandottu dórmor din azad fa ki zoruri no ne?" </char><verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Isaye ei hotabattara zehon hoiye, hibar bifokkor beggune šorminda oiye. Kintu Isar duwara ze šomosto mohimar ham oiye, henot baki šomosto manuš okkol kuši oiye.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uggwa šoṛo dana edde išor mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Tarfore Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Allar raijjo kiyor ḍoilla? Ki loi ãi hiyanor tulona diyum?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Hiyan uggwa šoṛo danar ḍoilla, hono ekzone hiba loi zai nizor baganot lagaiye, bade hiba bari uiṭṭe edde uggwa gas oiye, ar faik okkole he gasor ḍeil okkolot baha bainde."</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Isaye abar hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi ki loi Allar raijjor tulona diyum?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/><char style="wj">Hiyan išor ḍoil, zin mayafuwainde tin barang moidat maze mišaiye, šeše hin fuli uiṭṭe."</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Haiṭṭa haṛiwala doroza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Ar Isaye šohore šohore edde fara fara guri guri šikka di di Zeruzalemor uzu giye. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Hetunot ekzone fusar goredde, "Malik, zara uddar far, hitara ki hom manuš?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Isaye hitare hodde, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/><char style="wj">"Haiṭṭa haṛiwala doroza bai golibolla har kušiš goro! Kiyollahoile ãi tũwarare hoir, bout kiye butore goilto kušiš goribo, kintu goli no faribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/><char style="wj">Góror malike uṛi zehon doroza bandi felaibo bade tũwara baire tiyai doroza baijjai howa šuru goriba, 'Malik, ãralla dorozagan kuli do!'</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">"Kintu Malike zuwab di hoibo, 'Ãi no sini tũwara hoṛiyar manuš.'</char><verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi tũwara howa šuru goriba, 'Ãra tũwar ekkui fũwati há fiya goijji, ãrare fõte fõte tũi šikka dila.'</char><verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu he malike hoibo, 'ãi tũwarare no sini, tũwara honttu aiššo. Horaf manuš okkol, ãr sarmottu dur oi zogoi!'</char><verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">"He zagat tũwara handa haṛi goriba edde zala zontronaniye dat loi dat gošiba. Hetunot tũwara dekiba, Ibrahim, Isak edde Yakub edde nobi okkol Allar raijjor butore ase, ar tũwarare baire felai diya oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><char style="wj">Ar fuk edde fosimottu, uttor edde doinottu manuš okkol ai Allar raijjot boibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Ar so, šešor hataror hono hono manuš foila oibo. Ar foila hataror hono hono manuš šešor hatarot oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde badša Herud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>He šomot hoekzon Foroši Isar hãse aišše edde hibare hodde, "Huzur! Õne entu ar oinno hono mikka zogoi, kiyollahoile badša Herude tũware mari felaito sar."<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Zo, tũwara zai he šiyalore hogoi, 'Aijja edde aiyerde hailla ãi bod ruh dafair edde biyaraimma okkolore aram gorir, ar tin dinor din ãr ham šeš goriyum.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Zen oibo ok, aijja, aiyerde hailla edde forure šeš gora foribo. Kiyollahoile en to oi no faribo, Zeruzalemor baire hono nobi dongšo o! </char><verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zeruzalem! Zeruzalem! Tui nobi okkolore kun goros, tor hãse zarare defeṛa o, hitarare fattor mari takos! Faikor maye zendilla hibar so okkolore fakor nise ekkui fũwati gore, ãi hoto bar hendilla tor šontan okkolore ekkui fũwati goitto issa goijji. Kintu tũwara razi no oila.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><char style="wj">Hetolla sa, tũwarar gór tũwarar muntu hali fori taibo. Ar ãi tũwarare hoir, tũwara ãre ar deha no faiba zetun foijjonto tũwara no ho, 'Šukuriya ze Mabudor name aišše.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ek forosir górot Isa Mosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Ek bar ekzon Foroši netaye Isare hitar górot hánar dawat diye. He din aššilde dórmor din, ar manušzone kub bala gori Isar uzu kiyal raikke. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Ar so, fula biyaram oiyede hendilla ekzon ošuikka manuš Isar sarme aišše. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Toi Isaye dórmiyo alem okkol edde Foroši okkolore fusar goredde, <char style="wj">"Musar ain mozin dórmor din honokiyore aram goro ki ejazot ase, naki nai?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Kintu hitara nizam oi taikke. Hetunot Isaye he manušware hate dori aram gori bidai diye.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Tarbade Isaye he dórmiyo neta okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara honokiyor fũwa ba goru zodi kuwat fori zagoi, dórmor din oile o ki tũwara hitarare hehon hentu tuli no lo ne?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Kintu hitara hiyanor zuwab o di no fare.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Šoṛo owar babute šikka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Ar dawatot aišše de manuš okkole ijjotor zaga ken gori basi lor deki, Isaye hitarare šikka dibolla ekkan kahani hoiye: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/><char style="wj">"Zehon honokiye tũware melat dawat de, hetunot tũi hánar ṭebilor uworor zagat zai no boiššogoi. Kiyollahoile oitfare tũwattuwaro aro ijjotdar honokiyore heṛe dawat diya oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/><char style="wj">Ze tũware edde hibare dawat diye hiba ai zodi tũware ho, ei zaga iyan ubare do, hetunot to tũi šorom faiba. Ar tũwattu beggunottuwaro nisor zagat zai bowagoi foribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/><char style="wj">Tũware honokiye dawat dile, bolke beggunottuwaro nisor zagat zai boiyo. Hen oile dawat diyede góror malike aiyore tũware hoibo, 'Bondu aro bala zagat zai boyogoi.' Hetunot oinno meheman okkolor sarme tũi ijjotta oiba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ze nizore usol gore hitare niso gora oibo, ar ze nizore niso gore hitare usol gora oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Ar ze Isare dawat diye, hitare Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũi zẽtte dũijjar otóba hazinnar hána goro, hẽtte tũwar bondu ba báiyaindore otóba egena gušṭire ba tuwangor ḍen gór bam góijjare dawat no diyo. Hen gorile oitofare hitara o tũware dawat dibo. Ar ei bafe tũwar dawat fũzi zaiboi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũi zẽtte hánar bebosta goro, hẽtte gorib, lula, anda edde ãtur, in okkolore ḍako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Henot tũwar balai oibo, kiyollahoile tũware firai dibolla hitarattu kissu no takibo, forhesgar okkol morattu uwafes zinda oibar šomot hinor enam faiba."</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍõr melar mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Zara hána haito boišše hitarar butottu ekzone ei hota funi Isare hodde, "Hite hoto baggitta, ze Allar raijjot haito boibo."<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Doro, hono ekzon mainše ekkan ḍõr mela goijje. He melat bout mainšore dawat diya oiye. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/><char style="wj">Mela zehon oiye, hite hitar gulamore di dawat diyede manuš okkolore hoito defeṛaiye, 'Aio, ehon hár kissu tiyar oiye.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu hitara ekzonor bade ekzone beggune bahana deha šuru goijje. Foila ekzone hodde, 'Ãi kissu zobin kinni, ãttu zaire hin sagoi forer. Ãi dawatot zai no faridde hiyanolla maf sai.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar ekzone hodde, 'Ãi fãs zura bolod goru kinni, hinore bala horaf forikka goitto zair. Ãi dawatot zai no faridde hiyanolla maf sai.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"Oinno ar ekzone hodde, 'Ãi biya goijji, hetolla ãi zai no farir.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi he gulam firi zai hitar malikore ei šob hota zanaiyegoi. Henot góror malike hitar gulamore rag gori hodde, 'Tui toratori šohoror rasta rasta edde goliye goliye za, gorib lula, anda, ãtur okkolore eṛe loi ai.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hite giye edde malike zen zen hoiye hen hen goijje. Toi hite górot firi ai hodde, 'Huzur, kintu ehono kissu hána háibar zaga hali ase.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>
    <char style="wj">"Henot malike gulamore hodde, 'Šohoror baire rasta rasta edde fõte fõte za, eṛe aibolla mainšore zurgor, zene ãr gór bori zagoi.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, zarare dawat diya oiye hitarar butottu honokiye ãr ei melat hána hái no faribo."</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biššaši oite ki muillo diya fore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Bout manuš okkol Isar fũwati zat aššil. Isaye hitarar uzu muk firai hodde:<verse eid="LUK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ze ãr hãse aiye hite zene nizor baf ma, bou fuwain edde bái boin, enki nizore foijjonto ãttuwaro hom adoijja boli mone gore. Hen no gorile hite ãr biššaši oi no fare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><char style="wj">Ze honokiye fotti din nizor duk hoštore bordaš gori ãr fise no aiye, hite ãr biššaši oi no fare.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwarar butore zodi honokiye ekkan usol gór banaito sa, toile hite age boi horosor hisab gori no saibo ne? Hite saibo hiyan bandi šeš gori farefan hitattu ṭĩya ase ne nai. </char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hite ṭuni gãri bade zodi bandi šeš gori no fare, toile ze mainše hiyan dekibo hitara beggune ṭaṭṭa uraibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/><char style="wj">Hitara hoibo, 'Manušwaye banda šuru goijje kintu šeš gori no fare.'</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zodi ekzon razaye oinno ar ekzon raza loi zuddo gorito za, hite foila boi sinta goribo, kuri hazar šonnioye ãr loi zuddo goitto aiyer, šude doš hazar šoinno loi ki ãi hitarare tiya gorai fariyum?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/><char style="wj">Zodi hite hitar loi no fare toile hite oinno raza dure taite hitar loi šanti sukti goribolla manuš defeṛaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/><char style="wj">"He bafe, tũwarar butore zodi honokiye bafi sinti hitar hár kissu sari no aiye, hen oile hite ãr biššaši oi no fare.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>
    <char style="wj">"Nun bala ziniš, kintu nunor moza zodi nošto oi zagoi, toile hin ken gori abar nun oibo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/><char style="wj">Hetunot hin šude felai diya sara, zobinot fãš hisabe o ar bebar gora no zaibo.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">
    <char style="wj">"Zattu funibar han ase hite funok!"</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Hãzi giyegoide soolor kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Ar hazna adaigoroya edde gunagar manuš okkol beggune Isar kalam funibolla Isar hãse aišše. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Henot Foroši okkole edde dórmiyo alem okkole monmonai endilla howa šuru goijje, "Ei manušwaye gunagar okkolore gose edde hitarar fũwati há fiya gore."<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Isaye hetunot hitarare ei mesal kahanigan hoiye: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/><char style="wj">"Doro! Tũwarar butore hono ekzonottu ek šottuwa berasool ase. Zodi hinor butottu uggwa berasool hãzi zagoi. Toile ki aro nobboi noware maṛot raki, he uggware zetun tuwai no fa he foijjonto ki tuwaito no zaibo ne?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/><char style="wj">Ar hite zehon hiba tuwai faibo, hite kuši oi hibare handot tuli loibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/><char style="wj">Bade górot ai hitar fũwajja okkol edde ḍen gór ba gójjare ḍaki hoibo, 'Aiyo! Ãr fũwati kuši goro, kiyollahoile ãr hãzi gilgoide berasoolguwa tuwai faiyi.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, ṭik hendilla, ekzon gunagar gunattu mon firaile behostot aro beši kuši oibo, zarattu monfira no fore, hendilla nobboi nozon forhesgaror babute heto beši kuši no oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hãzi giyegoide rufar foišar mesal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">"Otóba hono ekzon mayafuwattu doššan rufar foiša ase, hibaye zodi ekkan hãzai fele, toile serag zalai gór kũsai zetun hiyan tuwai no fa, he foijjonto bala gori tuwai no saibo ne?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/><char style="wj">Toi hibaye zehon hiyan tuwai faibo, hibaye fũwajja okkolore, ḍen gór bam gójjare ḍaki hoibo, 'Aiyo! Ãr fũwati kuši goro, kiyollahoile hãzi gilgoide foišagan ãi abar tuwai faiyi.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/><char style="wj">Ṭik hendilla, ãi tũwarare hoir, ekzon gunagar gunattu mon firaile Allar firista okkolor maze kuši aiye."</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uwafes firi aiššede fuwar mesal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Ekzonottu duizon morod fuwain aššil.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/><char style="wj">Šoṛo fuwawaye bafore hodde, 'Baba, šombottir ze borat ãr bagot fore, hiyan ãre difelo.' Henot hite hitar dui futor maze šombottigun borat gori diye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/><char style="wj">Hotodin din bade he šoṛo fuwawaye hitar har šombotti besi ṭĩya loi ek duror dešot giyoi. Ar heṛe hite altifalti zibon haṛai hitar nizor ṭĩya foiša urai felaiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/><char style="wj">Hin horos goijja oiye, bade he dešot kub beši raṭ oiye. Henot hite obafot fora šuru goijje.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/><char style="wj">Toi hite zai he dešor ek girostorot sahara loiyegoi. He manušwaye hitare šuwor soraibolla hitar maṛot defeṛaiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/><char style="wj">Toi hite šuworor adar hái feṭ boraito saito, edde honokiye hitare hono kissu no dito.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hite zehon hitar nizor bul buzi faijje, hite hodde, 'Ãr bafor góror hoto muzur okkole beši beši hána far, kintu ãi eṛe bukke morir.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/><char style="wj">Ãi uṛi ãr Bafor heṛe zaiyum edde ãi hoiyumboi: O baf, ãi Allah edde tũwar berudde guna goijji.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/><char style="wj">Ãre tũi tũwar fuwa ho he zuiggota ãttu ar nai, kintu ãre tũi šude tũwar oinno muzur okkolor ḍoil gori ãre rako.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/><char style="wj">Endilla hoi hite hitar bafor heṛe giye.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <char style="wj">"Hite dure taite bafe hitare deki hitalla doyaye dil bori uiṭṭe. Ar hite fuwar hãse dũri zai, gola sai berai dori galot suma diye.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>
    <char style="wj">"Fuwaye hodde, 'O baf, ãi Allah edde tũwar berudde guna goijji. Ãre tũi tũwar fuwa ho he zuiggota ãttu ar nai.'</char><verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu hitar bafe hitar gulam okkolore hodde, 'Toratori barik kurutawa ano edde itare gat diyai do, õlot õri, ṭengot šendal findai do.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/><char style="wj">Ar boli muṭa goruror sowa ano edde hiba zorgorao. Aiyo, mela gori edde hafiya gori.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ãr ei fuwa mori gilgoi edde ehon zinda oiye. Hite hãzigilgoi edde abar fa giye.' Toi hitara mela edde há fiya šuru goijje.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hetunot ḍõr fuwawa bare ketit aššil. Hite aite aite zehon góror hãsa hãsi fõisse, hetunot tal bazana nasor abaz fuinne.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/><char style="wj">Toi hite ekzonore ḍak mari fusar goredde: Eṛe ki oiyede?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/><char style="wj">Hite hodde: Tor šoṛo bái firi aišše, hitare šušondane firai faiyede hetolla tor bafe boli muṭa gorur soware zorgoraiye.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>
    <char style="wj">"Henot he ḍõr báiye gušša oiye edde górot no goilto saiye. Toi hitar bafe góror baire zai hitare górot golaibolla fot dori hoiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/><char style="wj">Kintu hite bafore hodde, 'So, hara bosorṭiya ãi tũwalla gulami gori aiyir, ar hono din tũwar hokumor baire no zai. Hen abostat maze o tũi ãre fũwajja okkol loi kuši aiyaši goribolla hoi uggwa soolor so foijjonto no do.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/><char style="wj">Kintu ze fuwaye tũi dilade ṭĩya foiša beggun beššiya okkolor fise hossa gori felaiye, bade górot firi aišše, hitalla boli tũi muṭa goruwa zorgoraiyo!'</char><verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bafe hodde, 'O fut, tui hamiša ãr fũwati asos, ar zin ãttu ase hin tor.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/><char style="wj">Kintu ãrattu mela gori kušiaši goron zorulot, kiyollahoile tor ei bái mori gilgoi, abar zinda oiye. Hite hãzigilgoi, abar hitare fa giye.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ošot menezaror mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde: <char style="wj">"Hono ek tuwangor mainšottu ekzon menezar aššil. He tuwangor manušwaye mainšottu funedde ei menezare hitar dón šombotti sarhar gori feler.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/><char style="wj">Hetunot hite menezarore ḍaki fusar goredde, 'Tor babute ãi in ki funir? Tor hamor hisab de, kiyollahoile tũi ar ãr menezar hisabe tai no faribi.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hetunot he menezare mone mone hodde, 'Ãi ehon ki goijjum? Ãr malikede ãre hamottu niyolai der. Ãttu meṛi haṛibar o šokti nai, ar ãttu horat magite o šorom lage.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/><char style="wj">Zen oibo ok, malike hamottu niyolai dile, mainše zene ãre hitarar górot takito de he bebostalla ãttu ki gora foribo ãi zani.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">"En hoi, zitara hitar malikor hãsottu šud loiye hitarare ekzon ekzon fottikiyore ḍaikke edde foila ekzonore hodde, 'Tui ãr malikottu hozzo hodun loiyos?'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hite hodde: 'Ek šot mon tel.'</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">
    <char style="wj">"He menezare hitare hodde, 'Tor hozzor habosgan lo edde toratori boi, hiyanot fõnzaš mon lek.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>
    <char style="wj">"He menezare ar ekzonore hodde, 'Tor hozzo hodun?'</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">"Hite hodde, 'No šot mon gĩyu.'</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">"Menezare hitare hodde: 'Tor habosot hãt šot mon lek.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>
    <char style="wj">"He menezar ošot oile o hite aholor ham goijje boli hitar malike hitar bala nam goijje. Kiyollahoile ei duniyair manuš okkole nizor zatir babute fohoror fuwain okkolottuwaro beši buddiwala.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, ei horaf duniyair dónor duwara mainšolloi egenafoti zurao, zenneki he dón furai gilegoi bade hitara abadul abad takibar zagat tũwarare gose.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zare šoṛo befaror uwore biššaš gora za, hitare ḍõr befaror uwore o biššaš gora za, ar šoṛo befare zare biššaš gora no za, hitare ḍõr befare o biššaš gora no za.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/><char style="wj">Ei duniyair dón šombottir befare zodi tũwarare biššaš gora no za hen oile tũwarare biššaš gori asol dón hone dibo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/><char style="wj">Oinnor šombottir uwore zodi tũi obiššaši o, tũware nizolla šombotti hone dibo?</char><verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hono gulame dui malikor šeba gori no fare, kiyollahoile hite ekzonore hingša goribo ar ekzonore ador goribo, otóba hite ekzonor uzu mon dibo, ar dusora zonore hela goribo. Allah edde dón šombotti ei duior šeba o tũwara ekku fũwati gori no fariba."</char><verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Torar ain edde Allar raijjo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Moti 11:12–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Toi Foroši okkol zara ṭĩya foišar lalsiwala, hitara Isar ei šob hota funni Isare loi ṭaṭṭai goijje. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarattu to mainšor muntu forhesgar kuwalaito mon, kintu Allaye tũwarar monor abasta zane. Manuše ziyan šorman mone gore hiyan Allar sukot niroš."</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">"Torar ain edde nobi okkolor kitab mozin torikotor gusol doya Yahyar ṭaim foijjonto soille. Tarfore oite Allar raijjor kušir hóbor tobolig gora or, ar beggune heṛe golibolla ṭelaṭeli gorer. </char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><char style="wj">Tarfore o Musar šoryotottu uggwa horof bad forattuwaro bolke asman zobin šeš oi za aro bout asan oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ze honokiye nizor bouwore sari di ar ekzonore biya gore hite zena gore. Zamaiye sari diyede hendilla bouwore ze biya gore hite zena gore.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazarus edde ekzon tuwangoror mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ekzon tuwangor manuš ze baiyonna rongor hor edde dami dami horsuwor findito. Hite fotti din kub zak zomok há fiya loi zibon haṛaito.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/><char style="wj">He tuwangor manušwar gaṛaṛ duwaror ḍake Lazarus name ekzon horat magoyare buwai dito. Hitar hara gat gá aššil.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/><char style="wj">He tuwangor manušwar hánar tebilottu ze hána fori zaitoi hin hái hite feṭ boraito issa gorito. Kũir okkole hitar gá lekito.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ek din he magoyawa mori gilgoi. Hetunot firista okkole hitare tuli loi zai Ibrahimor kulot buwai dilgoi. Tarfore ek din oi tuwangor manušwa o mori gilgoi, edde hitare hoborot garai fela oil.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/><char style="wj">Hite jahannamot kub zontrona loi uworor mikka sail, ar durottu tai dekedde Ibrahimor kulot Lazarus.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/><char style="wj">Hetunot oi tuwangor manušwaye ḍak mari hodde, 'Baf Ibrahim ãre rahamot goro. Lazarusore defeṛo, ãi zene hitar õlor matagan fanit bizai ãr zil ṭanḍa gori fari. Ei oinor zilhat ãi beši duk fair.' </char><verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu Ibrahime hodde, 'O fut, mone gori sa, tũi basi takite hoto šuk goijjili ar Lasare hoto duk toziya faiye. Kintu ehon hite eṛe šuk gorer ar tui duk for.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/><char style="wj">Hin bade o tũwara edde ãrar maze ekkan beši ḍõr fák ase, honokiye issa gorile o enttu farai tũwarar heṛe zai no fare edde henttu farai ãrar hãse ai no fare.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hetunot he tuwangorwaye hodde, 'Toile baf, meherbani gori Lazarusore ãr bafor górot defeṛo,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/><char style="wj">zene ãr he fãs báiyore hite hũšiyar gori di fare. Ar no oilede hitara o ei zontronar zagat aibo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu Ibrahime hodde, 'Musa nobi edde nobi okkolor kitab to hitarar hãse ase. Hitara hinottu diyan di funok.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>
    <char style="wj">"He tuwangor manušwaye hodde: 'No, no, baf Ibrahim, mora okkolor butottu honokiye zaile hitara gunattu mon firaibo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi Ibrahime hodde, 'Musa nobi edde nobi okkolor hota zodi hitara no fune toile morar butottu honokiye uṛile o hitara biššaš no goribo.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Gunar uskani, mafgora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Isaye hibar sahabi okkolore hodde: <char style="wj">"Gunar fõtot loizaibar uskani sarme no aibo, hen to oi no fare, kintu bifod hitare, zar duwara hin aibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/><char style="wj">Ze ei šoṛo okkolor butottu ekzonore honokiye gunar fõtot ṭani loi zade o, henoile hitare golat ḍõr fattor bandi di doriyat felai diya hitalla aro beši bala oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><char style="wj">Hetolla tũwara nizor babute hũšiyar taikko.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">
    <char style="wj">"Zodi tor báiye tor berudde hosuri gore, toile tui hitare hen no goribolla mana gor. Ar zodi hite mon fira toile tui hitare maf goride.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/><char style="wj">Zodi ek dinor butore hite hãt bar tor berudde hosuri gore edde hãtobar ai ho, 'Ãi ei oinnaittu firi aišši,' toile hitare tottu maf gori diya foribo."</char><verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Ar asab okkole malik Isare hodde: "Ãrar iman barai do." <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Uggwa horoir dana borabor biššaš o zodi tũwarattu take edde ei gassware endilla ho, 'Ei gas, šiyõr udda šoho hãri zai doriyat fuṭgoi,' toile he gaswaye tũwarar hota manibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar tũwarar butore endilla hone aso, zar gulame al so otóba sool sora, hite górot aile hoiba 'Tui ehon ai, hána haito bošgai?'</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/><char style="wj">Bolke hitare ki no hoiba ne? 'Ãi ki háiyum hinor entezam gor! Ar zetun ãttu hána haiya no o, hetun kiyail bandi ãre šeba gor! Tarfore tui hána hái faribi!'</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/><char style="wj">He gulame malikor hokum mainne buli ki hitar malike hitare šukuriya zanaibo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/><char style="wj">He bafe har hokum mani bade o tũwara ho, 'Ãra niroš gulam, ziyan goribar zimma ãra šude hiyan goijji.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doš zon kurus biyaraimma aram oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Ehon Isaye Zeruzalem zaibar šomot Sameriya edde Galilor mazottu di giye. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Hibaye hono ek farat góillede šomot došzon kurus biyaraimma manuš hibar sarme foijje. Hitara dure tiyaiye edde, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>guzori hodde: "Isa, Malik, ãrare doya goro!"<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Isaye hitarare deki hodde, <char style="wj">"Zo, imam okkolor hãse zai nizore dehogoi."</char> Zaite zaite hitara faksaf oi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Toi hitarar butottu ekzone aram oi giyegoide otfaiyore hite guzori Allar tarif gorat uwafes firi aišše, <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>edde Isar fõt uite fori Isare šukuriya zanaiye. He manušwa aššilde Sameriyar manuš.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Došozon pak saf no o neki? Ar nozon hoṛe?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/><char style="wj">Ei ofor manušwa sara ki ar honokiye Allare tarif goribolla no ailo?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Toi Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Uṭ edde zagoi! Tor biššaše tore bala goijje!"</char><verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Allar raijjo hõtte aibo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:26-28">Moti 24:26–28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37–41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ek bar Foroši okkole Allar raijjo hõtte aibo Isare fusar goijje. Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Allar raijjor suke deha no za.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/><char style="wj">Ar manušore o no hoibo, so, Allar raijjo ei zagat ba o zagat, kiyollahoile so, Allar raijjo to tũwarar butore ase."</char><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Toi Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde: <char style="wj">"En šomoi aibo zẽtte tũwara Adomor Futor šomoir ekkan din dekibolla issa goriba, kintu deha no faiba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/><char style="wj">Hẽtte manuš okkole tũwarare hoibo, 'So, Adomor Fut o zagat!' So, 'Adomor Fut ei zagat!' Kintu tũwara heṛe no zaiyo, ba hitarar fisa no loiyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/><char style="wj">Zendilla asmanor ek mikkattu bizoli somkile asmanor nise oinno mikka foijjonto fohor o, Adomor Futor dinot o hendilla oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/><char style="wj">Kintu ei šob goṭibar age, Adomor Futottu beša beši duk bug gora foribo. Ar ei halor mainše hibare batil goribo.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar Nuh nobir ṭaimot zendilla oiye, Adomor Futor ṭaimot o hindilla oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><char style="wj">Manuš okkole há fiya goijje, biya goijje, biyata oiye, ze foijjonto Nuh nobi kištit no gole. Toi bor tuwan aišše edde beggunore šeš gori felaiye.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>
    <char style="wj">"He bafe Lutor ṭaimot o hendilla oiye. Hẽtte mainše háiye edde fiye, beisse edde kinne, lagaiye edde banaiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/><char style="wj">Kintu ze din Lut Súdum šohorottu niyoli giyegoi, hedin asmanottu oin edde oini šilor zór fori hitara beggunore dongšo gori felaiye.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>
    <char style="wj">"Adomor Fut ze din nizore forhaš goribo, he din o hendilla oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/><char style="wj">He dinor din zodi honokiye góror sãdor uwore take, ar hitar šomošto zinišfati góror butore take, henoile hite hin loibolla lami no ai ok. Hendilla ze maṛot take, hite górot uwafes firi no ai ok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><char style="wj">Lutor bouwor hota monot gori so!</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><char style="wj">Ze nizor foran basaito sa, hite hiyan haraibo. Kintu ze foran hara, hite hiyan uddar faibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir: He raitta ek bisanat duizon takile ekzonore loi za oibo, ar oinno ekzon fori takibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/><char style="wj">Duizon mayafuwain ek ḍeit gĩyur dana dufe. Hentu ekzonore loi za oibo, ar oinno ekzon fori takibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/><char style="wj">(Zodi duizon manuš maṛot take, hentu ekzonore loi za oibo, ar oinno ekzon fori takibo.")</char><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Toi sahabi okkole fusar goredde:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">"Malik, hoṛe goṭibode?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Mora ga zeṛe, heṛe hawa aiye."</char><verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Himmot no haraiyo, hamiša munazat goro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Toi hibaye hitarare ekkan mesal kahanir babute hoiye zene hitara hamiša munazat gore edde niraš no o. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Hibaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Ek šohorot maze ekzon bisarhar aššil. Hite no ḍoraito Allare, ar no manito manušore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/><char style="wj">Ar he šohorot ek rari maya fuwa aššil. Hibaye he bisarharor hãse zai hoitode, 'Oinnair berudde tiyai ãr bifokkor hatottu ãre uddar goro!'</char><verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bisarhare hoto din foijjonto kissu no gore, kintu bade mone mone hite hodde, 'Zodi o ãi Allare no ḍorai, manušore no mani.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/><char style="wj">Tarfore o ei rari mayafuwawaye ãre zalar, hetolla oinnaittu ibare ãi uddar goriyum. Ar no oilede hibaye hamiša ãre zalat takibo.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Toi Malik Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ošot bisarhare ki hor funor ne!</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/><char style="wj">Toile zara din rait Allar hãse handa haṛi gore, he Allar basai gora okkolore ki hitarar oinnair berudde tiyai soiyi bisar no goribo? Naki hin goitte Allaye deri goribo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, hibaye toratori hitarar fokke niyai bisar gori dibo. Kintu Adomor Fut zẽtte aibo, hẽtte ki hibaye ei duniyait iman dekibo?"</char><verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Foroši edde hazna adai goroyar mesal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Zara nizore nize forhesgarde biššaš goitto ar oinno mainšore hela gorito, hendilla hoekzon mainšore Isaye ei mesal kahanigan hoiye: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/><char style="wj">"Duizon manuše dórmogórot munazat goitto giye. Hitarar butore ekzon aššilde Foroši alem ar ekzon hazna adaigoroya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/><char style="wj">Foroši alemwaye zai en zagat tiyayegoi zeṛe hitare deha za. Toi hite hitar nizor babute duwa gorer, hite hodde, 'Oh Allah, ãi tũware šukuriya zanai ze ãi oinno mainšor ḍoilla no, ṭok, ošot edde zena goroya no, enki oi hazna adai goroyar ḍoilla o no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/><char style="wj">Ãi haftaye dui bar ruza raki, ãr šomosto hamanir doš bagor ek bag tũware di.'</char><verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu hazna adaigoroya manušwaye dure tiyaiye edde asmanor uzu suk tuli o sai no farer, bolke hite buk bajjai bajjai hodde, 'Oh Allah, ãi gunagar, ãre rahamot goro.' </char><verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare hoir, he hazna adai goroyare Allaye forhesgar hoi mani loiye, hite arame górot firi giyegoi. Kintu he forošire no. Toile buzi so! Ze honokiye nizore usol gore hitare niso gora oibo, ar ze nizore niso gore hitare usol gora oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde gura fuwain okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Hitara gura gura dudor fuwain okkolore o Isar hãse ainne, Isaye zene hitarar uwore hat rake. Sahabi okkole hen deki hitarare gozgozaiye. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Kintu Isaye gura fuwaindore hãse ḍaikke edde hodde, <char style="wj">"Gura fuwaindore ãr hãse aito do, hitarare band no diyo, kiyollahoile Allar raijjo itarar ḍoilla mainšor.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ze honokiye ugguwa gura fuwar ḍoilla oi Allar raijjo no gose, hite hono mote heṛe goli no faribo."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde ek tuwangor manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ek Ihudi netaye Isare fusar goredde: "Oh bala ustad, akéri zibonor miraz faite ãttu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Kintu Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãre kiyolla bala hor? Allah ekzon sara ar honokiye bala no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><char style="wj">Tũi to hokumgun zano, 'Zena no goijjo, kun no goijjo, suri no goijjo, misa goba no diyo, tũwar baf mare ijjot goro.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Hite hodde, "Gura halottu loti ãi in okkol falon gori aiyir."<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Isaye ei hota funiyore hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ehon o tũwattu ekkan ham baki ase. Zo, tũwattu za kissu ase hin beggun besi felo, ar gorib okkolore baṛi do, henot behostot dón faiba. Tarfore ai ãr fisa lo."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ei hota funi hite beši ferešan oiye, kiyollahoile hite aššilde ek ḍõr tuwangor manuš. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Toi Isaye hitar uzu saiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tuwangor okkololla Allar raijjot gola ken duk!</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/><char style="wj">Tuwangor okkol Allar raijjot golattuwaro fuišor fa bai uṭ gola aro asan."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Zara fuinne hitara hodde, "Henoile uddar hone oi faribo? Henoile Allar raijjot hone goli faribo?"<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ziyan mainšolla ošombob, hiyan Allalla šombob."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Toi Fitore hodde: "Ãralla ken oibo? So, ãra nizor hár kissu felai aišši edde õnor fisa loiyi!"<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ze honokiye Allar raijjolla buli nizor gór ba bou, bái boin, ma baf, ba fuwain eri diye,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/><char style="wj">hitara fottikiyor ei zugot o bout gun edde aiyedde zugot o akéri zibon faibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar moron edde uwafes zindar agam hóbor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Bade Isaye hibar barozon sahabire ek ḍeikka loi zai hodde: <char style="wj">"So, ãra Zeruzalem zair, Adomor Futor befare nobi okkole zin zin leikke, he mozin ãre di furon oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/><char style="wj">He zonore Oihudi okkolor hatot tuli diya oibo. Hitara he zonore loi ṭaṭṭa edde ofoman goribo, ar hibar gat sep maribo,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/><char style="wj">beša beši souk maribo edde hibare mari felaibo. Ar tin dinor din abar zinda uṛi zaiboi."</char><verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Kintu sahabi okkole in kissu buzi no fare. Hitarattu Isaye hoiyede hotar mani gufon roigiyegoi. Hitara Isar hota buzi uṛi no fare.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye ek anda manušore bala goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Ar zẽtte Isa Zeriku šohoror hãsa hãsi aišše, he šomot ekzon anda manuše rastar kinare mager. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>He anda manušwaye manuš okkolor ãṛar abaz funi fusar goredde: Ki oiyede? <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Mainše hitare hodde: "Nasarator Isa ei fõt bai aiyer."<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Hetunot hite guzori hodde: "Oh Nasarator Isa, Daudor šontan, ãre uwore doya goro."<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Zara age age giye, hitara, suf tak, hoi he manušware dõk diye. Kintu hite aro beši sikkarai howa šuru goijje, "Oh Daudor šontan ãr uwore doya goro."<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Toi Isa tiyaiye edde he manušware Isar hãse anibolla hokum goijje. Hite zehon Isar ḍake aišše Isaye hitare fusar goredde, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/><char style="wj">"Tui ki sos, ãi tolla ki gorium?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Hite hodde, "Malik, ãi suke deki farifan gori do."<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Dor, deki far! Tor imane tore aram goijje."</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Henot hite hehon suke deki faijje edde Allar tarif gori gori Isar fisa loiye. Ar manušor dol, zara iyan deikke hitara o Allar tarif goijje.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Sakkeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Bade Isa Zeriku šohoror butottu di zar. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ar so, heṛe ekzon Sakkeus name manuš aššil. Hite oilde ekzon hazna adaigoroya okkolor mazi, ek tuwangor manuš. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Ar hite Isare saito kušiš goijje, kintu hite baiṭṭa buli manušor zamot Isare sai no fare. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Toi hite Isare sai farefan, mum mikka dũri zai ek ḍũir gasor uwore uiṭṭe, kiyollahoile Isa he fõt bai gil.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Bade Isaye zẽtte he zagat fõisse, hetunot Isaye uwor mikka sai hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Sakkeus, toratori lami ai, kiyollahoile aijja ãttu tor górot taka foribo."</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Henot Sakkeuse toratori lami aišše edde Isare kušir sãte mehemandari kobul goijje.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Kintu hen deki beggune monmonaiye, "Isaye ekzon gunagaror górot rait haṛaito zar."<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Kintu heṛe Sakkeuse tiyai malik Isare hodde, "Malik so, ãr šombottir oddok ãi gorib okkolore dir. Ar zodi oinnai bafe honokiyor hono kissu ṭokai taki, toile hinor ãi sairgun firai diyum."<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Hetunot Isaye hitare hodde: <char style="wj">"Uddar aijja ei górot aišše, Sakkeus o ekzon Ibrahimor šontan.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile zara hãzi giyegoi hitarare talaš edde basaibolla Adomor Fut aišše." </char><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doššan šunar mohoror kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Ar zara Isar hota funnil hitarare Isaye šikka dibolla ekkan mesal kahani hoiye, kiyollahoile Isa zeṛe aššil hentu Zeruzalem beši dure nuwaššil. Ar mainše mone goijje Allar raijjo hara deha zaibo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Isaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Ek usol bongšor manuše razagiri firai anibo hoi ek duror dešot giye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/><char style="wj">Ar hite hitar nizor došzon gulamore ḍaki fottizonore ekkan ekkan šunar mohor diyore hodde, 'Ãi zeto din foijjonto firi no aiyi, in diyore šodori goijjo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu hitar dešor mainše hitare hingša goitto, hitara hitar fise manuš defeṛaiye endilla hoibolla, 'Ãra no sai, ei manušwa ãrar raza ok!' </char><verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>
    <char style="wj">"Zen oibo ok, ei manušware raza banaiye edde hite górot uwafes firi aigiyegoi. Toi hite ze gulam okkolore ṭĩya dil, hitara šodorit hone hodun amodoni goijje hin saibolla he gulam okkolore hitar hãse ḍaikke.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi foila ekzon ai hodde, 'Malik, tũwar ekkan šunar mohore aro doššan šunar mohor hamaiye.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>
    <char style="wj">"Razaye hitare hodde, 'Bala goijjos tui ãr bala gulam! Kiyollahoile tui oti šoṛo hamot o biššaš dehaiyos etolla doššan šohoror uwore šašon goribar kemota dilam.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi dusora ekzon aišše edde hodde, 'Malik, tũwar šunar mohor loi aro fãssan mohor ãi hamaiyi.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi razaye hitare hodde, 'Tore o fãssan šohoror uwore šašon goribar kemota dilam.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"Bade ar ekzone aiyore hodde, 'Malik, doro tũwar šunar mohorgan. Ãi iyan fakit nummalot bandi raki dilam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/><char style="wj">Ãttu tũware ḍor laigge, kiyollahoile tui ekzon hora manuš, zin no rako hin tũi tuli lo, edde zin no lago hin haṛo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hite hitare hodde, 'O horaf gulam, ãi tor mukor hota loi tor bisar goriyum. Tui to ãi hora manuš de zaniti, zin no raki hin ãi tuli edde zin no lagai hin ãi dai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/><char style="wj">Henoile ãr ṭĩya udar loyare kiya no dos, hen goriti buli ãi aile šudor fũwati hin uwafes adai gori faittam?'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi heṛe aro zara tiyai aššil hitarare hite hodde: 'Itar hãsottu šunar mohorgan loifelo edde zattu doššan mohor ase hitare iyan o do.' </char><verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hitara hodde, 'Malik, hitattu de age loti doššan mohor ase!'</char><verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>
    <char style="wj">"Malike hodde, 'Ãi tũwarare hoir, zattu ase, hitare aro diya zaibo, kintu zattu nai, hitattu asede hin o loifela oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/><char style="wj">Tũwara zo! He dušmon okkol zara ãi raza oi no sa, hitarare eṛe ano edde ãr šaikkat hitarar holla lo.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemot Isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Ei šob hota hoi bade Isaye hitarar age age Zeruzalemor mikka uṛa šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Bade zẽtte Isa zaitun faharor ato hãse asede Betfage edde Betani farar hãsa hãsi oiye, hetunot hibaye duizon sahabire faṭai diye endilla hoi: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/><char style="wj">"Oi sarmor farat zo, heṛe goli mottor ek gadar so banda dekiba, zibar uwore hono manuš hono din no boiye. Hiba kuli ãlla loi anogoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/><char style="wj">Honokiye zodi hiba kiyolla kulor hoi fusar gore, toile endilla hoiba, 'Ibare malikottu dorhar oiye.'"</char><verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Toi zarare defeṛa oiye, hitara zai Isaye hoiyede mozin hár kissu deikke. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Hitara he gadar so zehon kuilto saiye, giros okkole hitarare fusar goijje, "Tũwara gada sowa kiyolla kulor?"<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Hitara giros okkolore hodde, "Iba malikottu dorhar ase."<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Tarfore sahabi okkole he gadar soware Isar hãse ainne. Toi hibar fiṛot hitarar hor bisai di, heṛe uwore Isare buwaiye. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Bade Isa zehon za šuru goijje, hẽtte manuš okkole hitarar nizor nizor hor okkolore rastat bisai diya šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Ar Isa zehon Zaitun faharottu lamibar zagar hãsa hãsi fõissegai, hen šomot biššaši okkole ze šob kuduruti ham deikke, hin okkololla kušir sãte guzori guzori hitara beggune Allar tarif goijje. Hitara howa šuru goijje:<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>"Rahamot he badšare, ze Malikor name aiyer!"</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">"Behostot šanti ok ar Uwore Allar mohima ok!"<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Manušor zamor butottu hoekzon forošiye Isare hodde, "Huzur, õnor sahabi okkolore mana goro."<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Kintu Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ai tũwarare hoir, itara zodi suf take, toile fattorgune guzori uṛibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Isaye Zeruzalemor hãsa hãsi fõssi šohoror uzu saiye edde hiyanolla sukor fani felaiye. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Ar hodde, <char style="wj">"Tui aijja o zodi šanti kiye de hiyan buziti, kintu tui no buzor, ehon he šob tor sukor arguwale oi taikke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/><char style="wj">Endilla ṭaim aibo zẽtte tor dušmon okkole sairo mikkattu zonzal bandibo, tore giri doribo edde tore šomosto kunattu geruwa goribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/><char style="wj">Ar tore edde tor butoror šontan okkolore meṛi loi fišai felaibo, tor butore uggwa fattoror uwore fattor takito no dibo. Kiyollahoile Allaye tore basaito ze šuzug diye he šomoi tui sini no los."</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemor dórmogórot Isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Tarfore Isaye dórmogórot góille edde heṛe zara besa kina goijjil hitarare henttu baire lorai diye. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Leka ase: 'Ãr gór munazator gór oibo.' Kintu tũwara iyanore ḍahaiṭor aḍḍahana banai felaiyo."</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Isaye fotti din dórmogórot zai šikka dito. Ar ḍõr imam edde alem ar mainšor neta okkole Isare furai felaibolla kušiš goijje. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Kintu hitara ki bafe hen goribo he ufai tuwai no fa, kiyollahoile manuš beggune diyan di ekmone Isar hota fuinto.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Isar kemotar babute suwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Moti 21:23–27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mark 11:27–33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Ek din Isaye dórmogórot manušzon okkolore šikka der edde bala hóbor tobolig gorer. Hen šomot ḍõr imam okkol, alem okkol edde bura murobbi okkol hitara beggune fũwati ai Isare hodde, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>"Ãrare ho, tũi har kemota loi in goror? Tũware ei kemota diye de hiba honnuwa?" <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi o tũwarare ekkan hota suwal goijjum. Ãre ho: </char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/><char style="wj">Yahyar torikotor gusol, hiyan ki behostottu naki mainšottu?"</char><verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Toi hitara ekzone ekzon loi mošora gori hodde, "Zodi hoi, 'Allaro torfottu,' hen oile hite hoibo, 'Toile tũwara Yahyare biššaš ka no goro?' <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Ar zodi hoi, 'manušor torforttu,' toile mainše ãrare fattor maribo, kiyollahoile mainše Yahyare nobi mane."<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Hetolla hitara endilla zuwab diye, "Ãra hoi no fari hontu."<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile ãi o ki kemotaye ei šob gorir hin tũwarare no hoiyum."</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mirazdar edde ãngur ketir ošot ailla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Moti 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mark 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Tarfore Isaye mainšore ei mesal kahanigan howa šuru goijje: <char style="wj">"Hono ekzon mainše ekkan ãngur keti goijje. Hiyan saša okkolore lagaiyore lamba ṭaimolla hite oinno dešot giyegoi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/><char style="wj">Ãnguror ainda zehon aišše, hite hitar gular bag loi anibolla ekzon gulamore oi saša okkolor hãse defeṛaiye. Kintu hitara he gulamware mar doir goijje edde hitare hali hate dũrai diye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/><char style="wj">Bade malike ar ekzon gulamore defeṛaiye, kintu hitara hitare o mar dor gori edde ofoman gori hali hate bidai diye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/><char style="wj">Hendilla hite tisera ekzon gulamore o defeṛaiye, kintu hitara hitare o mari reza reza gori baire felai diye.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toi ãngur ketir giros hodde: 'Ãi ki goijjum? Ãi ãr adoijja fuware defeṛaiyum, oitofare hitara itare šorman goribo.'</char><verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu saša okkole hitare deki ekzone ekzonore howa hoi goredde: Ite oilde mirazdar, aiyo, ãra itare mari felai, toi mirazgun ãrar oi zaiboi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/><char style="wj">Bade hitara hitare ãngur ketor baire loi zai mari felaiye.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">
    <char style="wj">"Ãngur ketir girose hitarare loi ki goribo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/><char style="wj">Hibaye zai ei saša okkolore furai felaibo edde ketigan oinno mainšor hatot dibo."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ei hota funi mainše hodde, "Endilla no ok!"<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Kintu Isaye uzu hitarar mikka suk firaiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile endilla ze leka ase hiyanor mani ki?</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">"'Ze fattor raz mistiri okkole batil goijje,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">hiba i beši dorhari fattor oi uiṭṭe!' </char><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>
    <char style="wj">He fattoror uwore ze foribo, hite bangi ṭura ṭura oi zaiboi edde zar uwore he fattor foribo, hite guri oi zaiboi."</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>He šomot alem okkol edde ḍõr imam okkole Isare doitto saiye, kiyollahoile hitara buzi faijjil ze, oi kahanigan hitarar berudde hoiyede. Kintu hitara mainšore ḍoraiye.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hazna diyar babute suwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Moti 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mark 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Hetolla hitara Isare suke suke raikke. Ar hitara Isare šašon goroya bisar šoktir hatot tuli di farefan hoekzon spai defeṛaiye. He spai okkole bed dori Isar sarme forhesgar boinne, zene hitara Isar hotattu Isare gollot dori fare. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Toi hitara Isare fusar goredde, "Huzur! Ãra zani, õne zin ho edde šikka do hin ṭik, õne honokiyor uzu ṭan no goro, kintu soiyi bafe Allar rastar babute šikka do. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ãrare hosai, Romor badšare hazna diya iyan ãralla ṭik ki no?"<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar salaki buzi fari hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãre ekkan rufar foiša deho. Eṛe har foṭo edde nam ase?"</char><verse eid="LUK 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>Hitara hodde, "Romor badšar"<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Toile zin zin badšar hin badšare do, ar zin zin Allar hin Allare do."</char><verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Henot hitara manušor sarme Isar hotat hono šer tuwai no fa, bolke hitara Isar zuwab funi tajjuf oiye edde suf gori taikke.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uwafes zindar babute šikka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Moti 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mark 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Hodun Sadduki dolor manuše Isar hãse aišše, zara hono uwafes zinda nai hoito. <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>Hitara Isare hodde, "Huzur, Nobi Musaye ãralla leki giye, hono ekzonor bái zodi fuwain no owaite bouwore raki mori zagoi, toile hitar báiye he bouwore biya goribo, edde nizor báiyolla bongšo baraibo. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Ehon, hãt bái ase ek górot. He ḍõr báiye biya goijje, kintu fuwain no owaite mori giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Hitar nisor ḍõr báiye hibare biya goijje, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>tarfore tisera zone edde hendilla hãtozone biya goijje. Hitara beggune fuwain no owaite no owaite mori giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Šeše he mayafuwawa o mori giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ehon, hitara zẽtte uwafes zinda oibo, hitarar butottu hiba har bou oibo? Hibarede hãtozone biya goijje."<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Ei duniyair mainše biya gore edde biya difele.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/><char style="wj">Kintu zarare he duniyai edde mora okkolor butottu he uwafes zinda oibar laikka boli gona oiye, hitara biya o no gore ba biya o no de.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hitara ar mori no fare. Hitara firista okkolor ḍoilla. Hitara Allar góror fuwain, zarare morattu uwafes zinda gora oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><char style="wj">Kintu mora okkol uwafes uṛibode Musa nobir oin zoledde zongolor kahanit dehaiye, kiyollahoile Musa nobiye Mabudore, 'Ibrahimor Allah, Isakor Allah edde Yakubor Allah boli hoiye.'</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/><char style="wj">Hiba mora okkololla Allah no kintu zinda okkololla, kiyollahoile Mabudor šaikkat hitara beggune zinda ase."</char><verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Hetunot hozon dórmiyo aleme hodde: "Huzur, õne bala zuwab diyo!" <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>He oite Sadduki dole ar hono hota suwal goitte šahoš no fa.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi honnuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Moti 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mark 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Mainše ken goriyore Mosire Daudor fut hoi fare?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><char style="wj">Daud nize Zobur kitabot hor:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">"'Mabude ãr Malikore hodde:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">"Ãr ḍen ḍakottu boi</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>
    <char style="wj">zetodin ãi tor dušmon okkolore</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">
    <char style="wj">tor ṭengor tolat no raki."'</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>
    <char style="wj">Otoso Daude hibare 'Malik' ḍaker; toile hiba kengori hibar fut oi faribo?"</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alem okkolottu hũšiyar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mark 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Manuš okkole funedde šomot, Isaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/><char style="wj">"Alem okkolottu hũšiyar! Hitara lamba lamba hor findi beraito sa edde haṛot bazarot mainšor solam muzolišhanar usol zagat edde mela šobar barik zagat buware foson gore.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/><char style="wj">Hitara rari okkolor gór dokol gore ar mainšore dehaibolla lamba gori duwa gore. Hendilla mainše bisarot aro beši šasti faibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Gorib rari mayafuwar sodka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Bade Isaye suk tuli sadde, tuwangor manuš okkole dórmogóror dan bakšut hitarar nizor nizor sodka raker. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Ar o dekedde, ekzon gorib rari maya fuwaye o he bakšut duiyan foiša raikke. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Hetunot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ei gorib rari mayafuwawaye beggunottuwaro beši raikke.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile itara beggune nizor beši šombottittu kissu kissu dan bakšut raikke, kintu hiba obafi oi bade o, hibattu foran basaibolla zin aššil hin beggun di felaiye."</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiyamotor alamot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Heṛe biššaši okkolor butottu kiye kiye dórmogór babute hoil, hiyan ki šundor šundor fattore edde dan goijjede ziniš loi hãzaiya. Kintu Isaye hodde, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/><char style="wj">"Tũwara ei šob zin dehor, en din aiyer ekkan fattor ar ekkan fattoror uwore no takibo, beggun bangi fela oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zulumor šuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Moti 24:3–14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mark 13:3–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Toi hitara fusar goredde, "Huzur, in hõtte oibode edde in okkol šuru oibode hẽtte sinno ki?"<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Isaye zuwab diye: <char style="wj">"Saiyo, hono dúhat forizorgoi ne! Kiyollahoile boute ãr namor bed dori aibo, hoibo, 'Ãi Mosi' edde 'šomoi hãse aišše.' Kintu hitarar fise tũwara no zaiyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/><char style="wj">Ar zẽtte tũwara larai edde gonḍugulor hota funiba, hẽtte no ḍoraiyo! Kiyollahoile in okkol hameka foila goṭibo, kintu hehon ze šeš iyan o no."</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Bade Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Zatir bifokke zati edde raijjor bifokke raijjo tiyaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/><char style="wj">Ḍõr ḍõr busal oibo edde bout zagat raṭ edde bor biyaram okkol oibo. Ajib goṭona okkol goṭibo edde asmanot ḍor lagede hanḍo edde ḍõr sinno okkol deha oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu in goṭibar age manuš okkole tũwarare bondi goribo edde zulum goribo, sinagog edde ziyolot faṭaibo. Ar ãr namolla buli tũwarare raza edde šašon goroyar sarme ana oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/><char style="wj">Hetunot tũwara ãr babute goba diya šuzug oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwara ki zuwab diba hiyanolla agottu loti sinta no goribade hiyan ehon loti dilot yad rako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ãi tũwarar mukot hota zuhai diyum edde giyan diyum, tũwarar bifokkor honokiye tũwarare baron otóba zuwab di no faribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/><char style="wj">Kintu en ki tũwarar bab ma, bái boin, egena fũwajja okkole tũwarare dušmonor hãtot tuli dibo. Ar tũwarar kiyore kiyore hitara mari felaibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/><char style="wj">Mainše ãlla buli tũwarare hingša goribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwarar matar ekkan sul o dongšo no oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/><char style="wj">Tũwarar nizor sofore tũwarar nizor zibon furaiya faiba.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalem donšo oi zaiboi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar zẽtte tũwara Zeruzalemore armiye geruwa goijja dekiba, hẽtte hiyan donšo oibar ṭaim hãse aišše de zaniba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/><char style="wj">Hetunot zara Ehudiyat take, hitara fahari elehat dai zoggoi, ar zara šohorot take hitara baire dai zoggoi. Ar zara gang zagat take hitara šohorot no aiyok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ehon oilde šazar ṭaim, kitabot ze šob hota leka ase hin furon oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/><char style="wj">Afsus! He šomot hamilwala mayafuwain edde dudor fuwawala mayafuwain okkololla, kiyollahoile dešot beši durgoti oibo edde ei zatir uwore Allar gozob lami aibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/><char style="wj">Manuš okkol toluwaror tole oi oi moribo edde bondi hisabe hár zatir heṛe loi za oibo. Zetodin Oihudi okkolor ṭaim šeš oi no zagoi hetodin foijjonto Zeruzalemore Oihudi okkole hitar ṭengor tole ḍolibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar san surzo asmanor tara okkolot nanan ḍoilla sinno deha zaibo. Duniyait hár manuš okkole zontrona faibo. Doriyar goiror uzore hitara ḍore suhara oi zaiboi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/><char style="wj">Duniyait zin goṭibo hinor ḍore manušor foran sulor agat zaiboi, kiyollahoile san, surzo, tara okkol oulzoul oi zaiboi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><char style="wj">Ar he šomot hitara Adomor Futore ḍõr šokti edde mohima loi miyular butottu aiyedde dekibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/><char style="wj">Ei hanḍo beggun šuru oile o tũwara uṛi tiyaiyo, matá tuillo, kiyollahoile tũwarar azadi hãse."</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍũir gasor mesal kahanittu šikka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Ar Isaye hitarare ei mesal kahanigan hoiye: <char style="wj">"Ei ḍũir gaswa edde ar har gasor uzu so!</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/><char style="wj">Zehon hinottu noya fata fuṛe, hetunot tũwara hin sai hoi faro horan hal hãse aišše de.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/><char style="wj">He bafe tũwara o zẽtte ei šob oibode dekiba hẽtte zaniba Allar raijjo hãse aišše.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ze foijjonto in okkol furon no o, he foijjonto ei halor manuš okkolor mout no oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/><char style="wj">Asman edde zobin šeš oibo, kintu ãr hota hono din šeš no oibo.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seton tako, munazat goro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hũšiyar tako edde tũwarar kolobore beši niša fani hafiyar folai loi edde šongšari sinta loi kobza gori no raikko, zen atikka he din fandor ḍoilla oi tũwarar uwore no fore gai.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile he dingan duniyair hár manuš beggunor uwore foribo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwara hamiša seton taikko, munazat goijjo, zene he šob zin goṭibo hin okkolottu dai zaigoi faribolla edde Adomor Futor sarme tiyai faribolla šokti fo."</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Isaye fotti din dórmogórot zai šikka dito edde fotti raitta hibaye hentu bair oi Zaitun faharot zai takitogoi. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ar hár manuš okkol Isar hota funibolla kub binna sore dórmogórot zai Isar hãse hazir oito.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Isare doribar felain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Moti 26:1–5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14–16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mark 14:1–2</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>He šomot iš no diya ruṭir idor din hãse aišše, ze idore uddar id o howa za. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Ar dõr imam edde alem okkole ki bafe Isare mari felai fare hitara gufone he kušiš goijjil, kiyollahoile hitara manuš zonore ḍoraito.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Toi Ehudah Iskariyot, oi barozon sahabir ekzon, hitar butore Šoitan góille. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Toi hite ḍõr iman okkol edde dórmogór sõloya garḍ okkol loi dola oito giye edde kibafe Isare hitarar hatot tuli di faribo he babute mošora goijje. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Henot hitara kuši oiye edde hitare ṭĩya dibo wada diye. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ar henot Ehudaye o razi oiye edde manuš okkolor nozor arguwale Isare hitarar hatot tuli dibolla šuzug tuwa šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar šeš hána</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Tarfore iš no diya ruṭir idor butore ze din uddar idor sool kurbani gora o, he din aišše. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Toi Isaye Fitor edde Yuhannare hoi defeṛadde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zo, uddar idor hána tiyar gorogoi, ãra uddar idor hána háiyum."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Hitara hodde, "Hoṛe tiyar goijjum? Tũwar issa ki?" <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara šohorot golile ekzon manuše ek gora fani boi loi zadde lot faiba. Tũwara hitar fise fise, hite ze górot golibo, heṛe zaiba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/><char style="wj">Ar he góror malikore hoiba, 'Huzure fusar goijje, gorba gór hoṛe, zeṛe ãi ãr šahabi okkolore loi uddar idor hána hái fari?'</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/><char style="wj">Henot hite tũwarare ekkan šaz guz goijja dui ṭalar uwore ekkan ḍõr kamera dehai dibo. Heṛe zai tũwara hána gorogoi."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Hitara baisa diye edde Isaye zendilla hoil, he mozin lot faiye, ar hitara uddar idor hána tiyar goijje.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Bade ṭaim mozin Isaye asab okkolore loi haito boišše. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi duk šoibar age tũwarar fũwati ei uddar idor hána háiyum, ãi kub issa goijji.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare hoir, ze foijjonto Allar raijjo furon no o, ãi ar honokon ei idor hána na háiyum."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Bade Isaye fiyala loiye, šukuriya zanaiye edde hodde, <char style="wj">"Lo in, tũwarar maze bag gori lo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ãi tũwarare hoir, ze foijjonto Allar raijjo no aiye, ehon oite he foijjonto ãi ãnguror roš ar no fiyum."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Bade Isaye ruṭi loi šukuriya zanaiye edde hin bangi ṭura ṭura gori asab okkolore diyore hodde, <char style="wj">"In ãr ga, ziyan tũwaralla diya oiye. Ãre monot goribolla endilla goijjo."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Ar ekkui bafe, Isaye hána šeš oi bade fiyalawa hãtot loi hodde, <char style="wj">"Ei fiyala ãr louwor noya wadar sukti, ze lou tũwaralla ḍali diya oiye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/><char style="wj">Kintu so, ze ãlloi beimani goribo, hite ãr fũwati hána hár.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile zendilla faisala gori raikke, he bafe Adomor Fut zar. Kintu bifod hitar, ze Adomor Fut loi beimani gorer."</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Hetunot asab okkole ekzone ekzon loi fusar gora šuru goijje ze hitarar butore endilla ham hone goribo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Ar asab okkolor butore hone hokkolottuwaro ḍõr hin loi hitara hota haṛa haṛi goijje. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Oihudi dešor raza okkolena hitarar mainšor uwore munifgiri deha. Ar hitara zonogonor dusto boli o ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwara hendilla no oiyo. Bolke tũwarar butore ze beggunottuwaro ḍõr hite beggunottuwaro šoṛor ḍoilla ok. Ar ze neta hite šeba goroyar ḍoilla ok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hone ḍõr? Ki ze hánar ṭebilot haito boiye, hite, naki ze gulame hána baride, hite? Ze hánar ṭebilot haito boiye, hite no ne! Kintu ãi tũwarar maze šeba goroyar ḍoilla oi roiyi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/><char style="wj">Funo! Tũwara ãr har bola mosibot okkolot maze ãr fũwati roiyo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/><char style="wj">Ar ãr Bafe zendilla ãre šašon kemota diye, hendilla ãi o tũwara ekkan raijjo diyi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><char style="wj">Zene tũwara ãr raijjot ãr mezot boi há fiya gori faro. Ar tũwara šingašonot boi Israilor baro bongšor bisar goriba.</char><verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>
    <char style="wj">"Simon, Simon, sa! Šoitane tũwara beggunore gĩyur dana salefan salibolla dabi gorer.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/><char style="wj">Kintu ãi tolla duwa gorir, zene tor iman komzur no o. Tui abar zẽtte ãr hãse firi aibi hẽtte tor báiyaindore tui tuwajjo dis."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Fitore Isare hodde, "Malik, õnor fũwati ãi ziyolot zaibolla edde moribolla o razi asi."<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Fitor, ãi tore hoir, aijja rata kuraye bak no dite, tui ãre no sinos hoi tin bar ošikar goribi."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Tarfore Isaye sahabi okkolore fusar goredde: <char style="wj">"Ãi zẽtte tũwarare ṭiyar toli, gaṭṭi edde zuta in hono kissu sara defeṛailam, tũwarattu ki hẽtte hono kissur obaf oil ne?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Hitara hodde, "Na, no o."<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Hetunot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Kintu ehon zattu ṭiyar toli ase, te hin lok, ekkui bafe gaṭṭi o lok. Zattu toluwar nai hite hitar kuruta besi ekkan toluwar kinok.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ãi tũwarare hoir, pak kalamot ze leka ase: 'Adomor Futore naforman okkolor fũwati gona oiye,' hendilla ãr duwara furon oibo. Kiyollahoile ãr babute zin howa oiye, hin furon or."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Hetunot sahabi okkole hodde, "Malik, so, eṛe duiyan toluwar ase."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Oiye oiye!"</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye Zaitun faharot duwa gorer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Moti 26:36–46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mark 14:32–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Bade Isaye niyoli zai nizor rosom mozin zaitun faharor mikka fõt bai za šuru goijje. Ar fũwati sahabi okkol o fise fise giye. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Isa heṛe fõsi bade sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara duwa goro, zene tũwara forikkat no foro."</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Bade Isaye hitarattuwaro hom beši ek dolar fõtot giye edde ãṛu feli munazat gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Munazatot hodde, <char style="wj">"Ya, Baf, zodi tũi so, ãr hãsottu ei motor fiyala dur goro. Tarfore o ãr issaye no, tũwar issaye furon ok."</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Hetunot behostottu ekzon firista aiyore Isare šokti diye. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Toi Isaye moron hoštoye mogno oi aro issa zuge munazat goijje. Ar Isar gar gám zen lour fuṛar ḍoilla oi meṛit fora šuru goijje.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Isaye munazat gori uṛi bade sahabi okkolor hãse aišše, ar dekedde hitarare, monor dukkor zoriya gumot fori giyoi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Gum zor kiyolla? Uṛo, forikkat no forofan duwa goro."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Isaye hota howat roiye, hen šomot so, heṛe ek ḍõr mainšor dol aišše. Ehudah, ze barozon sahabir ekzon, hite o hitarar fũwati age age aišše. Ehudaye Isare suma diyore dehai dibolla Isar hãse giye. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Kintu Isaye Ehudare hodde: <char style="wj">"Ehudah, sumar duwara ki Adomor Futore dori dor?"</char><verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Isar fũwati zara aššil hitara ki ki goṭibo hin buzi fariyore Isare fusar goredde: "Malik, ãra ki suri loi hamela goriyum?" <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Ar hitarar butottu ekzone, ek ḍõr imamor gulamore hamela gori hitar ḍen han haṛi loi felaiye.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Kintu Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tam, ar hen no goris!" </char> Bade Isaye hitar han suiyore hitare bala gori diye.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Isare doribolla ze ḍõr imam okkol, dórmogór sõloya garḍ okkol edde murubbi okkol aišše. Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi ki ḍahait ze tũwara laṛi sura, toluwar loi aiššo?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><char style="wj">Ãi zẽtte fotti din dórmogórot tũwarar fũwati aššilam, hẽtte to ãr uwore tũwara hat o no tulo. Kintu ehon tũwarar šomoi, andaror razotto soler."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitore Isare tin bar ošikar goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Toi hitara Isare dori loi giyegoi edde Isare ḍõr imamor górot ainne. Ar Fitor o dure taki hitarar fise fise giye. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Bade manuš okkol zara uṛanot oinor ṭal zali boišše hitarar fũwati Fitor o boišše. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Heṛe oinor ṭalor forot Fitor boiššede ek bandi maya fuwaye deki hitar mikka suk firai hodde, "Ei manušwa o utar fũwati aššil."<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Kintu Fitore ošikar gori hodde, "He maya fuwa, ãi hitare no sini."<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ekkena gori bade ar ekzone Fitorore deki hodde, "Tui o to hitarar ekzon."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Fitore hodde, "Na, ãi no."<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Gonḍa anik bade ar ekzone zure hodde, "Soiyi, ei manušwa o hitar fũwati aššil, kiyollahoile ite o Galil elehar manuš."<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Hetunot Fitore hodde, "No, tui ki hor ãi buzi no farir." Fitore hen hoiya šeš no oite uggwa rata kuraye bak di uiṭṭe. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Hetunot Malik Isaye Fitoror mikka muk firai saiye. Henot Isaye ze hota hoil: <char style="wj">"Aijja ratakuraye bak no dite, tui ãre no sinos hoi tinbar ošikar goribi,"</char> hiyan Fitorottu monot foijje. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Hetunot Fitore baire zai kub hainde.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ihudi dórmor murobbi okkolor sarme Isa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Ar Isare sõi roiyede manuš okkole Isare loi ṭaṭṭa goijje edde maijje. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Hitara Isar suk bandi Isattu fusar goredde, "Tui zodi nobi oi takos toile ho sai, tore hone maijje?" <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ar hitara ingša gori Isar berudde aro bout hota okkol hoiye.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Din zehon oiye, Ihudi dórmo komitir murubbi okkol, ḍõr imam okkol edde alem okkol beggune ekkui fũwati dola oiye. Toi Isare hitarar munttu ana oiye <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>edde hodde, "Tui zodi he Mosi, toile ãrare ho!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Zodi ãi tũwarare hoi, tũwara biššaš no goriba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/><char style="wj">Ar zodi tũwarare fusar gori, hono zuwab no diba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/><char style="wj">Kintu ehonottu loti Adomor Fut šoktiwala Allar ḍen ḍakottu boiṛa takibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Hetunot hitara beggune fusar goredde, "Toile ki tui Allar Fut?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Isaye hitarare zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Tũwara hor ze, Ãi Hiba."</char><verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Toi hitara hodde, "Ãrattu ar gobar ki dorhar? Ãra beggune hitar nizor mukottu funilam."<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Filator sarme Isar bisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Bade hitara dol šoho beggune uṛi Isare Rom šašok Filator hãse loigiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Ar hitara Isar berudde en hoi nališ goijje, "Ãra dekki ei manušwaye ãrar zatire kufõtot loi zargoi. Romor badšare hazna no dibolla mainšore mana gorer, ar nizore Mosi edde badša dabi gorer."<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Toi Filate Isare fusar goredde, "Tui ki Ihudi okkolor badša?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Isaye Filatore zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũi ze hor."</char><verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Toi Filate ḍõr imam okkolore edde manušor dolore hodde, "Ãi ei manušwar hono hosuri no fair."<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Kintu hitara zid gori howa šuru goijje, "Ehudiya elehar har zaga okkolot šikka di di ite manuš okkolore gonḍogul bazaider. Ite in Galilottu loti šuru goijje, ar ehon eṛe aišše."<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Ei hota funi, Filate manušwa Galilor ne ki hoi fusar goijje. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Isa badša Herudor šašonor tole asede zani fari Filate Isare Herudor hãse faṭai diye. Ar he šomot Herud Zeruzalemot aššil.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Herudor sarme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Badša Herude Isare deki beša beši kuši oiye, kiyollahoile hite Isar babute bout hota funnil, ar bout din dori hite Isare saibolla issa gori aššil. Ar Herude aša goijje Isaye hono keramot gori dehaibo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Herude Isattu bout suwal okkol fusar goijje, kintu Isaye hitare hono zuwab no de. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Ar ḍõr imam edde alem okkol tiyaiyore Isare beši hosuri diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Toi Herud edde hitar šena okkole o Isare ofoman goijje edde ṭaṭṭa goijje. Toi Herude Isare raz fušak findai abar Filator hãse faṭai diye. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Hedin Herud edde Filat hitara ekzon loi ekzon dusto oi giyegoi, hiyar age hitarar butore dušmonai baf aššil.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filate Isare kurušot dibar rai funaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Tarfore Filate ḍõr iman okkol, neta okkol edde manuš okkolore ekkui fũwati ḍaki, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>hitarare hodde, "Tũwara itare ãr hãse ainno edde hoiyo, ei manušwaye manuš okkolore kufõtot loizar. Ar so, ãi tũwarar šaikkat bisar gorile o, tũwara hitar uwore ze šob duš okkol dor, hinor butore ei manušwar hono hosuri no fair. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Ar Herude o no fa. Hetolla Herude itare ãr hãse uwafes faṭaiyede. Ar so, ei manušwaye moron šaza faibar laikka o kissu no gore. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Hetolla ãi hitare šasti diyore eri diyum."<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>(Filate ei šob hota hoiyede haron oilde he idor ṭaimot hitaralla ekzonore eridiya oito.)<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Kintu hitara dol šoho beggune uzor diyore hodde, "Itare dur goro, ãralla Barabbasore sari do." <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Ei Barabbas zare šohoror maze danga edde kunor harone ziyolot bondi gori raka oiye.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Deš šasiyot goroya Filate Isare eri dito saiye hetolla abar hite mainšor dolor hãse zanaiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Kintu manuš okkole guzori hodde, "Itare kurušot do! Kurušot do! Itare mari felo!"<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Filate tin mottor barot hodde, "Kiyolla? Ite hosuri ki goijje? Ãi hitare šazaye mout dibar hono hosuri no dekir, hetolla ãi itare šasti di eri diyum."<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Kintu Isare kurušot diya oibolla hitara zid gori beši uzor diya šuru goijje. Toi hitarar uzor kamiyaf oiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Filate hitarar issa mozin goribar hokum di felaiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Danga edde kungorar harone ze Barabbasore ziyolot raka oil, hitara hitare saiye. Toi Filate hitare hitaralla eri diye, kintu Isare mari felaibolla tuli diye. Hitarar issa furon oiye.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare kurušot diya or</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Tarfore hitara Isare loi zadde šomot Šimon name ekzon Kuronir manuš farar butottu di aiššil. Hitara Isar fise fise kuruš boi loi zaibolla he manušwar handot kuruš tuli diye. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ar bout mainšor dol okkol fise fise giye. Hitarar butore bout mayafuwain okkol aššil, zara Isalla bilag gorer edde šuk tuli hander. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar mikka firiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"O Zeruzalemor hoinna okkol, ãlla no haindo, bolke nizolla edde nizor nizor fuwaindolla hando.</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile so en šomoi aiyer zẽtte tũwara hoiba, 'Šuki he bázá mayafuwain okkol, zarar udore hono fuwain no owa, zarar buke hono din dud no de!'</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><char style="wj">He šomot </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">"'manuš okkole faharore hoibo, "Ãrar uwore for!"</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">Ar mura okkolore hoibo, "Ãrare guri rak!"'</char><verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Kiyollahoile mainše hail gasor uwore zodi en gore, toile fuwana gasor uwore ki no goṭibo?"</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Aro dusora duizon ašami manušore o Isar fũwati mari felaibolla loi za oiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Hitara Matakuli name ek zagat fõsi bade heṛe šena okkole Isa edde he duizon ašamire kurušot loṭkaiye, ekzonore Isar ḍen ḍake ar ekzonore bam ḍake gori. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Hetunot Isaye Allare hodde: <char style="wj">"Ya Bab, itarare maf goro, kiyollahoile itara ki gorer hin itara no zane."</char> Bade šena okkole Isar horgunore loṭari kelai bag goijje.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Manuš okkole tiyai sai taikke, kintu Ihudi neta okkole Isare loi ṭaṭṭa goijje edde hodde: "Ite oinno manuš okkolore basaito, zodi hite Allar he Mosi, Allar basai gora, toile ehon hite nizore basaok."<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Ar šena okkole Isare horor roš dito saiye edde hitara ṭaṭṭa gori hodde, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>"Tui zodi Ihudi okkolor badša os, toile nizore basa."<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Ar Isar matar uwore ekkan sainboṛot mari diya aššil ziyanot leka ase: "Iba Ihudi okkolor badša."<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Ar ze duizon hosurbonore kurušot ṭaikke, hitarar butore ekzone ṭiṭkari di Isare hodde, "Tui Mosi no ne? Tui nizore edde ãrare basasena!"<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kintu ar ekzon ze ase hite itare zejjeṛai hodde, "Tui šaza for, to ki Allare o boi no goros? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Ãra usit šaza fair, zin goijji hinor fól hisabe. Kintu Isayede hono kuham no gore."<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Tarfore hite Isare hodde, "Huzur Isa, õne zẽtte nizor raijjot oiba hẽtte ãre monot raikko."<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tore soiyi hoir, aijja tui ãr fũwati zonnotot oibi." </char><verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar moron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Hẽtte šomoi onumanik dũjja, beilore ganda doijje. Ar šara deš tin gonḍa mula andar oi taikke. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>dórmogóror forodagan uwottu loti siri dui bag oi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Isaye guzori hodde: <char style="wj">"Oh Baf, ãi tũwar hatot ãr ruh tuli dilam."</char> Ei hota hoi bade Isaye hibar šeš niyaš felaiye.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Ei šob hanḍo deki ekzon Romor šenar boroye Allare tarif gori hodde, "Hãsa ei manušwa soiyi aššil." <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Ar ze šomosto manuš okkole ei hanḍo saibolla zoma oiye, hitara zin zin goiṭṭe hin okkol deki buk bajjai bajjai henttu giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Ar Isar sin foriso zara edde ze mayafuwain okkol Isar fũwati Galilottu aišše, hitara šoho beggune dure tiyai in okkol saiye.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare hobor diya or</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Moti 27:57–61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mark 15:42–47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yuhunna 19:38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Ar heṛe Yusuf name ekzon manuš aššil, dórmo komitir ekzon ze bala edde soiyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Komitir mainše hormo hanḍo, solla mošora zin Isar babute goijje hinot ei manušwaye razi oi no fare. hiba aššilde Ehudiyar Arimatiya farar manuš. Hibaye Allar raijjolla boi aššil. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Hiba Filator hãse zaiyore Isar lašwalla saiye. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Bade laš lamai kafonor hoor berai di fattorot kuinda, en ek hoborot raikkegoi, zeṛe honokiyore age heṛe raka no o. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>He din dórmo dinor tiyarir din, dórmor din onumanik šuru oi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Isar fũwati ze mayafuwain okkol Galilottu aiššil hitara Yusufor kure kure zai he hobor edde ki bafe Isar laš raka oiye hin saiyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Bade hitara firi giye edde kušbo mollom edde tel banaiye. Tarfore dórmor din Musar ain mozin hitara ziraiye.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Isar uwafes zinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Haftar foila dinot, binna kub sore, mayafuwain okkole hoboror hãse aišše, ze mosolla hin loi <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Heṛe hitara dekedde hoboror mukor fattorgan algaiya. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ar hitara hoboror butore zai sadde Malik Isar laš heṛe nai. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Hitara ammuwak oi ei befare bafedde šomot, so, ujjol fušak finda duizon manuš hitarar ḍake ai tiyaiyegai. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Henot he mayafuwain okkole ḍore meṛir uzu matá nise gori taikke. He duizone hodde, "Tũwara morar butore zindare kiyolla tuwor? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Hiba eṛe nai, hiba uṛi giyoi. Galilot takite Isaye tũwarare ki hoil hin monot goro. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Hibaye endilla hoilde no ne, <char style="wj">'Adomor Futore gunagaror hatot tuli diya oibo edde kurušot diya oibo. Ar tin dinor din hiba abar uṛi zaiboi.'"</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Hetunot Isar hota hitarattu monot foijje.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Toi hitara hoborottu firi giyegoi edde he egarozon asab edde aro oinno beggunore ei hota zanaiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>He mayafuwain okkolor butore aššilde hitara oilde: Mogdaleni Moriyam, Joanna, edde Yakubor ma Moriyam. Ar hitarar fũwati oinno mayafuwain okkol edde aro zara aššil, hitara beggune asab okkolore ei šob hota hoiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Kintu zara ei šob hota fuinne hitarattu hin baze hota hoiye fan laigge. Hitara mayafuwaindor hotare biššaš no gore. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Tarfore o Fitore uṛi hoboror mikka dũr diye, ar heṛe zai holla niyuri sadde šude hor fori roiye. Ar zin goiṭṭe, hinot hite tajjuf oi he zagattu firi giyegoi.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emmaus farat zade rastat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ar so, hedin duizon sahabi Zeruzalemottu hãt mail dure Emmaus name ek farat zadde šomot, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>hitara oi šomosto goṭonar babute hotabattara hor. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Hitara hotabattara hor edde fusar asar goredde hen šomot maze Isaye nize ai hitarar fũwati ãṛa šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Kintu hitarar suk zen bon oi giyegoi, hetolla Isare hitara sini no fare.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara ãṛat maze ekzonore ekzone ze šob hota howa hoi goror, hin ki?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Hitara nak muk hala gori tiyai roiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Bade zar nam Kleofas, hite hodde, "Tũi šude ekzon Zeruzalemot zoya oibo, ei hodinor butore heṛe ze goṭona okkol oiye hin no zanode."<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ki goṭṭiyede?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Hitara hodde, "In Nasarator Isar babute goṭona, ze Allah edde har mainšor šaikkat hotaye edde hame ek ḍõr kemotawala nobi aššil. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Kintu ken gori ḍõr imam edde ãrar dórmo komiṭir neta okkole moron šaza dibolla tuli diye edde kurušot mari felaiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ãra aša goijjilam iba hiba, zibaye Israil zatire azad goribo. Ar hin bade o, aijja tin din oiye in okkol goiṭṭede. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Ar ãrar hozon mayafuwainde o ãrare tajjuf goijje, hitara binna kub sore Isar hoborot giye. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Hitara Isar lašor deha no fa. Ar hitara henttu firi ai zaigoi bade ãrare hoiye, hitara ze firistar okkolor deha fail hitara Isa zinda ase buli hoiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Ar ãrar fũwajja okkolor butottu kiye kiye hoboror hãse zai, he mayafuwainde zen hoiye, hendilla zasai goijjegoi, kintu hitara o Isare no deke."<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Tũwara hoto bekub! Ar nobi okkole ze šomosto hota hoiye, hin beggun biššaš goitte hoto durbol!</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/><char style="wj">Mosiye ei šob duk bug gori nizor šanot golibolla hin gora ki zorulot no ne?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Tarfore Isaye Musar ain edde šomosto nobi okkolor kitabottu šuru gori har kitabot hiba nizor babute ze šob leka ase, hin okkol hitarare buzai diye.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Tarfore hitara zeṛe zar he farar hãsa hãsi fõssiyegai. Toi Isaye aro dure zaibar alamot dehaiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Kintu hitara hoisali gori hodde, "Ehon din to giyegoi, hãz oi giyegoi, õne ãrar fũwati tako." Henot Isa hitarar fũwati takibolla górot góille.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Tarfore Isa zehon hitarar fũwati hána haito boišše, hetunot Isaye ruṭi loi duwa goijje edde hin bangi hitarare diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Hetunot hitarar suk kuli giyegoi, hitara Isare sini faijje. Kintu Isa hitarar hentu gayeb oi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Toi hitara ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Isaye ãra loi fõtot maze hota hoiyede he ṭaimot edde ãrar hãse Pak kitabor mani kuli diyede hẽtte ãrar dilor butore zoli zoli no uṛe ne?"<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ar hitara hehon uṛi Zeruzalem firi giye. Toi he egarozon asab edde hitarar fũwajja okkol beggune zomula oiya deha faiye, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>ar hitara en hodde fuinne, "Malik hameka uṛi giyegoi, Simonore deha diye." <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Bade itara duizone o fõtor goṭonar babute edde ruṭi bangibar šomot hitara ki bafe Isare sini faijje, he šob hota hitara beggunore funaiye.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye sahabi okkolore dehaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Hitara ekzone ekzon loi howa hoi goredde šomot Isa nize ai hitarar maze tiyaiyegai. Hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarar šanti ok."</char><verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Henot hitara ḍore somki uiṭṭe. Ar hitara but dekere buli mone goijje. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara ḍoror kiyolla? Tũwarar dilot andaša ka anor?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/><char style="wj">Ãr hat ṭengor uzu so, so iba šoyong ãi. Ãre sui so, so ãre, butottu lou gusto no take zendilla ãttu asede dehor."</char><verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Ei hota hoi Isaye hitarare hat, ṭeng dehaiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Toi hitara eto kuši oiye, biššaš gori no fajjil ebbe ammuwak oi giyegoi. Toi Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarar hãse eṛe hono kissu háibolla ase ne?"</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Toi hitara Isare ekkan baijja mas diye. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Ar Isaye hiba loi hitarar šaikkat háiye.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Tarfore Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarar fũwati takite zin hoilam, he hota oilde endilla: Musar ain, nobi okkolor kitabot edde Zobur šorifot ãr babute ze hota leka ase hin hameka furon oibo."</char><verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarar dil kuli diye zene hitara Pak kitabor kalam okkol buzi fare. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Endilla leka ase ze: Mosittu toziya fa foribo edde tin dinor din hiba morattu uṛibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/><char style="wj">Ar hibar name guna maf faibolla edde mon firaibar hóbor hokkol zatir hãse tobolig gora oibo. In Zeruzalemottu šuru oibo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/><char style="wj">Tũwara in okkolor goba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><char style="wj">So, ãr Bafe ze wada goijje he wadare ãi tũwarar hãse defeṛaiyum. Ar behostottu šokti no fo foijjonto tũwara ei šohorot taikko."</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare asmanot tuli loi za oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Bade Isaye sahabi okkolore Betaniya foijjonto loigiye edde hitarare hat tuli duwa diye. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Toi endilla oiye, hibaye hitarare duwa gorat maze hitarattu alok oi giyegoi, edde hibare asmanot tuli loi za oiye. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Ar sahabi okkole hibare sojida goijje edde beši kuši oiyore Zeruzalem firi giyegoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Toi hitara hamiša dórmogórot taki Allare šukurana guzar gorat taikke.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
